<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ngindo Bible Vesion</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yohana nga gumwe kati ja itabu ncheche mu Lilagano Liyono elilanduli kutama kwa Yesu Kilisto padunia. Kila kitabu kikemigwa, “Injili” mana gakwe “Nhwalo gwambone.” Jenie jiandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kuboka pukujomoka Yesu. Nhwalo gwambone gwa Yohana upemeligwa uandikigwe na ndundame Yohana chaka 90 kuboka pukujomoka Kilisto. Iganukube kitabu kilengitije kutenda Yohana ngu nhwandiki, pikiandikigwe kilandine na balua ja 1 Yohana na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana. Bange akaandiki ba lolo balenga Yohana kukingobu chenie atama ku Efeso kuyene iwechakine kitabu chenje kiandikigwa kukilambo chuku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana aandika kitabu chenje kupala chajangate bandu baamini kutenda Yesu nga Kilisto, Mwana jwa Nnoongo juna bwomi (Lipungu lya 20:31). Kukuamini yene tuotwi kube na bwomi kwa lina lyakwe. Kitabu kiandikigwa kwa akachomi boa Akayahudi na bandu banga Akayahudi. Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yohana ulandine munoje ni minhalo jenge mitatu. Akachani muno kulenga minhalo ji ikobo yatenda Yesu nambu andiki munuje ilandanakio ya Yesu. Ilebe yenge ikolongwa andi kubatichigwa nu kulondoigwa kwa Yesu kupongoti iandikigwije Munhwalo Gwambone gongo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana atumbwi nhwalo gwambone mu (Lipungu lya 1:1-18).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe aandike nhwalo gu ikobo ichoko ya tenda Yesu (Lipungu lya 1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Kubokapenia alanduli ilebe mukutama kwa Yesu padunia yene nga eimpeleka mpaka mukiu nu kuyoka (Lipungu lya 13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana munhwalo gwambone ajomoli lipungu lya 21 alengiti kingobu chimwe Yesu ngabapiti bandu kuboka pukuyoka kuboka penia ngalenga chikintei aandike kitabu chenje.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lilobe elilitupe bwomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pitumbulaga pakiba jumwe ojwakemigwa Lilobe, jwombe Lilobe akiba kwa Nnoongo, na jwombe akiba Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuboka pitumbula Lilobe akiba pamwe na Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa kupetela jweno ilebe yowa ngipanganigwa, kikibaje wala chimwe chikipanganigwe panga jweno. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jweno akiba kindumbutumbu cha bwomi, na bwomi gweno ukiba lumuli lwa bandu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na lumuli lweno lumulika pulubendu, nambu lubendu lweno luotwije kuluimia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngantuma mundu jumwe liina lyakwe Yohana, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ojwaika kachalakicha bandu nhwalo gwa lumuli lweno. Aika kalenge bandu boa nhwalo gwakwe na babapakujoa baamini. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jweno akiba lumuliloje, nambu aika kachalakicha bandu nhwalo gwa lumuli lweno. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Londo nga lumuli lwa kweli, lumuli oluika padunia pano na kamulikila bandu boa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bai Lilobe akiba padunia pano. Iganu kube Nnoongo apangine dunia kupete jwenio, nambu bandu padunia bummanyije. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngaika kachakwe mwene, nambu bandu bakwe bampokije. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu bandu baba abampokilinge, ngubunhwamini ngabape kinala chukube ingota ya Nnoongo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ingota eibelwike kuwecho gwa munduje ngiti kwamakakala ga mmeleje ngiti kupala kwa munduje, ila kuboke kumwene Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jwombe Lilobe ngabe mundu, ojwa tweli upeele nakweli, ngatama kwito. Natwe ngitikibona kibumo chakwe, kibumo echapata ka Awawa mundu andi Mwana jwa jika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohana ngabachalakicha bandu minhalo ja jwenio, ngalonge kanonoya, “Jwenio nga jwanongila minhalo jakwe kulenga, ‘Aika mundu kuboka pangune nambu nkolongwa kumbeta ne, jwombe akiba ne tango nukubelekwaje.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ga kulimba kwakwe twe tuboa tupokile upeele nduu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nnoongo akatupe Malagilo kupetela kwa Musa, upeele na kweli jituikalila kwa kupetela Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Abije ngu mundu ojwammweni Nnoongo. Mwana jwa nnyika ojwabi tela na Nnoongo na ojwabi pamwe na Awawa, nga ojwatulandulila nhwalo gwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatichi alandulila nhwalo gwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gongo ngu uchaili gwapanga Yohana, kingobu akiilongoi ba Akayahudi bu Kuyelusalemu pabatuma akakung'i na Akalawi ku Yohana bankonye kulenga, “Mwe mabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Jwombe Yohana atindije kajanga, ngalenga kipola, “Kilisto neje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Penia ngabankonya, “Bai mwe mabeneke? Bo mwe nga Maeliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yohana ngajanga, “Je, ne je.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabankonya, “Bo, mwenga nga Nnondoli jola?” Jwajo ojwalondoligwe kupitila na atangacha kuika kwa Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p">Yohana ngabajanga, “Je.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Angweto ngabankonya, “Bai mwe mabeneke? Bo mmene mikilenga mabeneke? Mutulengele, ibe twe takapegange majango angweto ababukingite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohana ngajanga, nenga nga jwajo nnondoli Isaya ojwakiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo ojwalenga minhalo jango, kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nenga nga lilobe lya mundu lijoanika pampongoti.</para>
  <para style="q">Mmeke kipola ndela ja Angwana bapete!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bandu benia bakatumigwa na bange ba Mafalisayo, <verse number="25" style="v"/>bai ngabankonya Yohana, “Andi mwe Kilistoje, wala Eliyaje, wala nnondolije mbona mmaticha bandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohana ngabajanga, “Nenga maticha kwa mache, nambu abi jumwe ajemite panakati jinu jwangammanyanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jweno atendakuika kuboka pangone nambu ne kuotoje kulita na ukulugula ngoji ya ilatu yakwe.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">Mundu ataba ngoji ilatu yakwe</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ilebe yenie itendigwa okwo ku Betania, kwie ja lukemba Yolidani apakiba akabaticha Yohana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwana jwa Limbelele jwa Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe Yohana ngammona Yesu akanhwikilila, ngalenga, “Ojo nga Mwana Limbelele jwa Nnoongo ojwaboya mabaja ga padunia! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Jwenio nga jwanongila minhalo jakwe kulenga, ‘Kingobu tu kuboka pango ne, abakuika mundu jumwe ojwabi nkolongwa kupeta nenga, magambu akiba tango ne nukubelekwaje.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Namwene ne numanyije, nambu naicha kubaticha kwa mache ili bandu ba Kuisilaeli bumanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yohana ngachalakicha yene, “Nammweni Uhuke jwa Chwapi akauluka andi ngunda kuboka kumbengu nu kutola panani jakwe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nenga nummanyije, nambu Nnoongo ojwandumite kubaticha bandu kwa mache akanenge, ‘Mundu ojumpakummona Uhuke jwa Chwapi akatola panani jakwe, jwenio nga ojwabaticha ku Uhuke jwa Chwapi.’ ” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yohana ngalenga, “Nenga noile, na njalakicha ojo nga Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Akinapunji ba kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Malabu jakwe, Yohana akabe penia kabele pamwe na akinapunji bakwe abele. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apamona Yesu akapeta, ngalenga, “Nnola! Jweno nga Mwana limbelele jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Akinapunji benia apabannyoa Yohana akalongila malobe genia, ngabankengama Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngatendabuka, apababonanga akinapunji benia bakankengamaga, ngabakonyanga, “Mpalanga nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">Bombe ngabajanga, “Labi, ntama koo?” Labi mana gakwe Aboli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Tujendange, namangweto mannola.” Jakiba saa komi kimuyo, akinapunji benia ngabalongwana nakwe. Ngabapabona patama, ngabatama nakwe kimuyo choa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Jumwe kati ja akinapunji abele bala akiba Andulea, nnung'una gwakwe Simoni Petulo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Andulea akatumbu kunkole Simoni, nnung'una gwakwe, ngannenge, “Tumweni Masia” Masia mana gakwe Kilisto Nkomboi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngampeleka Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe Yesu ngannolokea Simoni ngalenga, “Mwenga ngama Simoni mamwana ba Yohana. Nambu kuboka ngoe nkemigwa Kefa.” Kefa ku Kiyunani Petulo, mana gakwe “Libwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakemanga Filipo na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Malabu jakwe Yesu ngaamua kujenda ku Galilaya. Bai ngankolela Filipo ngannengela, “Ungengame.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filipo akiba jwa kilambo chuku Betisaida, kabatamanga Andulea na Petulo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Jweno Filipo ngankolela Natanaeli, ngannenge, “Tumweni jwajo ojwaandikigwe na Musa mukitaabu cha Malagilo, ojwaba nhwandikinge akalondoli mialo jakwe, yani Yesu Mwana jwa Yusufu, mundu jwa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Jwombe Natanaeli ngankonya Filipo, “Bo, kilebe cha mbone kiwechite kuboka ku Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Filipo ngannengela, “Nhwike nnole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu pammona Natanaeli akanhwikililaga, ngalenga mialo jwakwe, “Nnola, ojo nga Mwisilaeli pyuu wala kindondoje nkati jakwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Jwombe Natanaeli ngankonya, “Mwe mmanyitabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Pamakiba nhwina munkojo, tango Filipo nukunkemaje ne ngunummona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Penia Natanaeli ngannengela, “Aboli, mwe ma Mwana jwa Nnoongo! Mwe mangwana ba Kuisilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Bo, nhwamini magambu nannengile namweni nhwina munkojo? Mamibona ilebe ikolongwa muno kupeta yenje!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulenga, “Nannenge kweli, mamukubona kumbengu kukajogoka na akapakachi ba Nnoongo bakajenda kunani nu kuuluka kunani pa Mwana jwa Mundu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mpapala gwa kutola akege kikilambo cha Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba lya tatu pakiba ngongano jukutola kukilambo cha Kana, okwo ku Galilaya. Amamundu Yesu bakiba kweno, <verse number="2" style="v"/>jwombe Yesu ate kokigwa penia pa mpapala gwa kutola akege pamwe na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apajapeta divai, amamundu, ngabannenge Yesu, “Bakwetangitije divai.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Amama, makanengeje chikutenda. Kingobu chango tango kuika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Penia amamundu ngabalengela akapakachi, “Chachoa chela achapakunengela ntendange.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akayahudi bakiba na lukobo lwa ukuya, penia pakiba na ibega chita ya mabwe, kila kibega chimwe kijingi madebe mabele au matatu ga mache gukuya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Ntweleyange mache mweno muibega.” Ngabatweleya twe mpaka kunani. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngabalengela, “Ngoe ntekange mapelekele akilongochi ba mpapala.” Ngabatekanga mache gala, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Akilongoi ba mpapala apabapaya mache gala, ngaba manya genia gayokite divai, Bombe bamanyije divai jene jibokitako, nambu akapakachi bala bamanyangite jibokitako. Akilongoi ba mpapala ngabakema bene akola mpapala, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akilongoi ba mpapala ngabalengela, “Kila mundu kutumbula kupangania oti divai jambone, kubokapenia anda batochike kupanga divai jambone. Nambu mwe mpangite divai jambone mpaka ngoe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu alaya iingi yi ikobo yu kutumbula okwo kukilambo cha Kana, Ku Galilaya, ngalaya kibumo chakwe, na akinapunji bakwe ngabanhwamini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kubokapenia, Yesu pamwe na amamundu na inuna yakwe na akinapunji bakwe, ngabajendanga kukilambo chuku Kafalanaumu ngabatamanga paali penia kwa machoba machoko tu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda munyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpapala gwa Pasaka ja Akayahudi jikiba jibandakile, yene Yesu ngajenda Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bai ngabakolelanga unyumba jenie bandu bakaucha ng'ombe, mambelele, na ngunda, na bandu abajangangana uloi bakiba batamite pamecha jabe.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Nhwucha ilebe ajangangana ela</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngatengenecha iboko ya ngoji, ngabenga boa panja ja Nyumba ja Nnoongo pamwe na ng'ombe na mambelele gabe ngaambugana salafu ya abajangangina ela ngapendangula mecha yabe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngabaamulicha baba abauchangita ngunda, “Mmoyange ilebe eye pamba. Makajitendaje nyumba ja Awawa bango kube choko!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabakombakela Majandiko Machwapi galenga, “Kupala kwango kwa nyumba jinu ungoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Akayahudi bange ngabankonya Yesu, “Nnaya kiingi nike chi ikobo kutenda nkweti uwecho gu ilebe yenie?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mmomole nyumba eje ja Nnoongo ne manjenga kwa machoba matatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia Akayahudi ngabalenga, “Nyumba ja Nnoongo eje jichengigwa kwa kingobu cha yaka alubaini na chita. Bo, mwe mpakuchenga kwa kingobu cha machoba matatu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu alongela nhwalo gwa nyumba ja Nnoongo, jene ukiba mmele gwakwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bai pubunhyoya, akinapunji bakwe ngabakombokela akiba alongela genia, ngabaaminianga Majandiko Machwapi na malobe gaga galongela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amanya myojo ja bandu boa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu kumpapala gwa Pasaka, bandu akajingi ngubunhwamini pibibona iingi yi ikobo eyatendaga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu akibaje na imani nabo magambu bamanyi boa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Penia apaije mundu jwajoa kunchalakicha minhalo ja bandu benia magambu mwene agamanyi goa agabi umojo jabe.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pakiba na kilongoi jumwe Nhyahudi, jwa kikundi cha Mafalisayo, liina lyakwe Nikodemo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe kilo Nikodemo ngannyendelela Yesu nu kunnengela, “Aboli, tumanyi mwenga maboli mantumigwe na Nnoongo. Abije mundu ojwaotwi kulaya iingi yi ikobo eintenda mwe pangabe Nnoongo kube pamwe nakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Nannenge kweli, abije mundu ojwa pakukibona Kingwana cha Nnoongo pangabelekwa kabele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nikodemo ngankonya, “Mundu munaota kuotolabo kubelekwa kabele? Kuotoje kujingila mulutumbo lwa amamundu nukubelekwa kabele!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Nannenge kweli, abije mundu ojwapakujingi Mukingwana cha Nnoongo nukubelekwaje kwa mache na Uhuke ba Nnoongo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mundu kubelekwa kwa mmele ka awawa na ka mama, nambu kubelekwa kiuke kwa Uhuke ba Nnoongo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Makaomwangaje magambu nannengile mpaka mmelekwe oti kabele. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Upepo kuuma ukujenda okupala, nnyoa lilobe lyakwe, nambu mmanyije okuuboka wala okujenda. Nga ibi kwa mundu ojwabelekwa kwa Uhuke ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nikodemo ngankonya, “Ile yenje kuotwabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo, mwenga nga aboli ba Isilaeli na mmanyije ile yenje? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, twe tulenga eituibweni na kachalakicha bandu ilebe itibweni, nambu mangweto kujeketeje nhwalo gwito. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kunhwaminije ne mangobu apanannengile mialo ja padunia pano, mpakunhwaminibo nenga, apambakunnenge ilebe ya kumbengu? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na abije mundu ojwaakajenda kumbengu ila Mwana jwa Mundu, aulwike padunia kuboka kumbengu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Anda Musa palijinula lijoka lya liyaba kwako kupongoti, unyae Mwana jwa Mundu mpaka ajinuligwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na kila mundu ojwanhwamini jwombe maba na bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Magambu Nnoongo atekupapala padunia pano muno ata ngammoya Mwana jwakwe jwajika, ibe kila mundu ojwapakunhwamini akaweje nambu apate bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Magambu Nnoongo antumitije Mwana padunia pano kahukumu bandu, nambu kakombolanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Bena abanhwamini Mwana kuhukumuligwaje, nambu benabo banganhwamini bai bahukumuligwe, magambu bunhwaminije Mwana jwa jika jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jenje nga namuna ja hukumu ejipakube, Lumuli luike padunia, nambu bandu bapala lubendu kuliko lumuli, gambu mialo jabe mibaja. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kila mundu ojwatenda gamboneje aluchimwa lumuli, nu kuikaje pulumuli, magambu kupalaje mialo jabe mibaja jibonekane. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu junakujali ukweli aika pulumuli, ili mialo jakwe ibonekane itendigwa kwa kunyali Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuboka kwa gena, Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngabaika pikilambo cha Yudea, ngatama kweno pamwe nabo kwa mangobu ngabaticha bandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohana uyo akiba akabaticha bandu kweno Kuainoni, papipi na Kusalemu, magambu kweno kwakiba na mache ndu. Bandu ngabannyendelela, jwombe ngababatichanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mangobu gena Yohana akiba tango anajigiligwaje kukipungo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mitau ngijipitila kati ja akinapunji bange ba Yohana na Nhyahudi jumwe kuuchu lukobo lwabe lukuya. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bai akinapunji benia ngabannyendela Yohana nukunnengela, “Aboli, mundu jola ojwakiba pamwe na mwenga kwiye ja lukemba Yolidani, mwenga ngumunchalakicha, ngoe jweno atenda kubaticha, na bandu boa bannyendelela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohana ngabajanga, “Mundu aotwije kube na kilebe mpaka ibe kuboka ku mbengu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na mmenimangweto nhwotolinge kuchalakicha kutenda nganenga, ‘Nenga Kilistoje, nambu ndumigwe ili nanongalele Kilisto!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Munkege jwatoligwe nkola jwatoile, nambu aganja ba jwatoile ojwajema nukupenikia, kuala mojo muno apabanyoa jwatoile akalenga. Nga laa jango apijikamilika. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mpaka jweno akoliigwe, na nenga nakakoliigwaje.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ojwaika kuboka kumbengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ojwaika kuboka kunani kumbingu nga anaota kuliko boa, ojwaboka padunia nga jwa padunia, na kalengela ile ya pakilambo. Nambu ojwaika kuboka kumbingu nga anaota kuliko boa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Jweno agagabweni nu kugajoa nga agachalakicha, nambu abije mundu ojwajeketela nhwalo gwakwe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwajote ojwajeketela nhwalo gwakwe achalakicha Nnoongo nga kweli. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwana ojwatumigwe kulongela malobe ga Nnoongo, jweno Nnoongo ampi Uhuke jwakwe changapemeka. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Awawa bampala mwana na bampile ilebe yoa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ojwanhwamini Mwana akweti bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, jwangannyali Mwana aibeje na bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, nambu kuchimwa kwa Nnoongo kuba kunani jakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na munkege jwa Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngabajoa Yesu akapata akinapunji ajingi na kabaticha kuliko Yohana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nambu ukweli, Yesu akibaje kabaticha bandu ila akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bai Yesu apajoa genia, ngaboka Kuyudea nukubuja Ku Galilaya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mumwanja gweno apaligwe kupetela Kusamalia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bai ngaika kukilambo chuku Sikali, kilambo chimwe cha ku Samalia, papipi na nng'onda gwa Yakobo gweno oguampile Mwana jwakwe Yusufu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paali penia pakiba na liliba lya Yakobo, jwombe Yesu gambu ja kutotokela kwa mwanja, ngatama umbwega ja liliba. Ikiba nalumu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bai munkege jumwe jwa Samalia ngaika kuteka mache, Yesu ngannengela, “Umbe mache nywe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mangobu gena akinapunji bakwe bakiba bajabulinge kunnyini kuemela ilyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambu munkege jweno ngannyanga Yesu, “Mwenga Mayahudi, nenga nakege ba Kusamalia! Nhwotobo kunyopa maache?” Akayahudi bakiba kujaikanaje ikombe na yani na Akasamalia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nganyanga, “Anda makamanyi kilebe echapanga Nnoongo, nga mene ojwannyopa mache, kabi mannyopite, najweno kabi ampile mache agaleta bwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Amama benia ngabalenga, “Angwana nkwetije lindobo lya kutekela mache na liliba linyolike. Mampatako mache gina bwomi? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Au mwenga mikitenda mananhota muno kapeta awabito Yakobo? Benia ngubutupe liliba lende, na benia bene, ingota yakwe na ilangwa yakwe ngabanywe mache ga liliba lende.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Kila ojwanywe mache ganga maba na nyota kabele. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu abapakunywe mache agambakape neenga, abe kabeje na nyota mache agambakape magaba nkati jakwe chembwe cha mache ga bwomi nu kumpe bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amama benia ngabannengela, “Angwana, umbe nenga mache genia ili nakabeje na nyota kabele, na nakaikaje kabele pamba kuteka mache.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nnyabule makakeme angwanabinu, nhwike pamwe nabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngannengela, “Ne ngwetije analome.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngannengela, “Nnengite kweli nkwetije analome. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Maana mmi na akinalome anhwano, na bena bantamanabo ngoe angwanabinuje. Penia nnengite kweli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngabalenge, “Angwana, nammona mwe iotwi kube malondoli. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akaoko bito bagongalela pikitombi uchenje, nambu Makayahudi paali pinu pukung'ongale Nnoongo nnenga Kuyelusalemu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “jwenio, nhwamini ne, kingobu kitendakuika penia abagongole Awawa bagongalela pikitombi panoje, nu Kuyelusalemuje. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Makasamalia mang'ongolela nnoongo jwangammanya, nambu Takayaudi tummanyi ojotung'ongolela, gambu ukomboi uboka kaka Yahudi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu kingobu kitenda kuika, iba abagongole kwa kweli bagongalela Awawa kuhuke jwa kweli. Gambu Awawa bapala bandu abagongale yenie. Nnoongo ngu uhuke na abagongalela bapaligwa kugongalela kuhuke na kweli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngu Uhuke, na bandu abagongalela bapaligwa kugongale kuhuke na kweli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngannenge, “Manyi Masia, jwakonda Kilisto atendakuika, na papakuika jwenio matulengela ilebe yoa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nenga nanonge na mwenga ngajweno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji bakwe ngababuja, ngabaomongwa kummona akalongela numunkege. Nambu akibaje mundu ojwankonyite munkege, kutenda, “Mpala nike pamba?” Wala Yesu bankonyiteje kulenga, “Mbone nnonge numunkege?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngakileka kiulo chakwe ngajenda kunyini kalenge bandu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngajemba chamila kulenga “Nhwikange mmoa makammone mundu ojwanengi ile yango yoa eindendite! Bo, jwenio aotwi kube Kilisto?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bandu ngababoka kunyini, ngabannyendele Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kingobucho akinapunji bakwe ngabannenge Yesu kulenga, “Aboli, nnieoti chakulya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalenge, “Ne ngweti chakulya changikimanya mangweto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabakonyana, “Bo, abimundu ojubaleti chakulya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Chakulya chango, kugakamwa gabapala abatuite nyomole maengo gabe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mangweto nnengalenga, ‘jiigi myei nchechetu mauno magaika!’ Nambu ne nannenge, nnolanga migonda jibi tayali kuunigwa! <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nhwuni mapata lipungu lyakwe, na akongo mauno ga bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, iba mpandi na nhwuni baalala mojo pamwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kilonge chenje chakweli jonge kupanda na jonge kuuna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nenga nantumangite makaunange ilyo yangapiyanga liyuke. Bandu bange bakamwi liengo, nambu mangweto mukikonjanga kuboke muliuke lyaabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Akasamalia ajingi bi kijiji chenie ngubunhwamini Yesu magambu ga malobe gachalakicha munkege jwenio, kukulenga, “Annengi itendwa yoa eindendite.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Akasamalia ngabannyendele Yesu ngabanyopa atame nabo, na jwenio ngatama penia machoba mabele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi muno ngabaamini magambu ga nhwalo gwakwe. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ngabalenge amama benia, “Twenga tuamini magambo ga lilobe linutuje, twetubene tujoine, na tumanyi jwenio nga kweli Nkomboi jwa dunia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mwana jwana afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kuboka pa machoba mabele Yesu ngaboka penia, ngajenda kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesu mwene ngachalakicha kulenga, “Nnondoli kupataje ichima kukilambo chakwe mwene, nambu kuyenge ilaambo kupata ichima.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bai paika kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya, Akagalilaya ajingi ngabampokela. Magambu angweto uyo bakibanga kumpapala gwa Pasaka, ngibibona ikobo yowa yatenda Kuyelusalemu kingobu cha kusikukuu jenie.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu ngaika kabele kukilambo cha Kana, kunkoa gwa Ku Galilaya, paali pa galambuya maache kube divai. Penia kilongoi jumwe jwa chilikali akiba na mwana ntamwe okwo ku Kafalanaumu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Bai jweno ofisa apajoa Yesu akiba abokite Kuyudea nukujenda Ku Galilaya, ngannyendela nukunyopa ajende kunnamia mwana jwakwe ojwabi ntamwe lola. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Pangibona iingi yi ikobo nu gukuomongwa miaminije!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kilongoi jweno ngabalengela, “Angwana, chonde tujende tango manango nukujomokaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nyabulage, mwanajwinu malama!”</para>
  <para style="p">Mundu jweno ngaamini malobe ga Yesu, ngajabula. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Apakiba undela, ngakongana na akabanda bakwe, ngabannengela, “Mwana jwinu alamite!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Jwombe ngabakonya mangobugani mwana apalama, ngabajanga, “Licho saa saba mui, kitamwe ngikinneka.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Awawa bena ngabakombokela ikiba kingobu ucho Yesu apalenga, “Mwana jwinu malama.” Penia bena ngabaamini pamwe na akalongamundu boa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yenie yakiba iingi yi ikobo ya pabele yatenda Yesu apakiba akaboka Kuyudea kujenda Kugalilaya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu papipi na lilaba lya maache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pa genia, Yesu ngajenda Kuyelusalemu kukiba na mpapala gwa Akayahudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kweno Kuyelusalemu, papipi na nniango ogukemigwa nniango gwa limbelele, pakiba na lilaba lya mache elikemigwa kwa Akaebulania Bethzatha, lyene lyakiba na nganya nhwano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Munganya mweno mwakiba na akatamwe ajingi bagolokinge, bangalola na nangwaba na babapolite. Bakiba bagalendela mache gatimbunike, <verse number="4" style="v"/>magambu kila kingobu Akapachi ba Nnoongo kuboka kumbengu batela kuika nukujingi umache nukutimbugana. Mundu jwajwoa ojwakiba jukutumbula kujingi umache kuboka pa mache kutimbunika ngalama kitamwe chachotichela echabinacho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pena pakiba na mundu jumwe ojwakiba ntamwe kwa mangobu ga yaka makomi matatu na nane. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu apammona mundu jweno agolwike pena ngamanya akiba ntamwe kwa machoba majingi, ngankonya, “Bo, mpala kulama?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ntamwe jola ngajanga, “Angwana, nenga ngwetije mundu jwa kumbeleka kumache mangobu apagatimbunika. Kila apanyiga kujingila, mundu jonge kumbengelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nyinuke, ntole likai linu nnyabule.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kingobu tu mundu jweno ngalama, ngatola likai lyakwe ngajabula.</para>
  <para style="p">Nhwalo gwenio utendigwa lichoba lya kupomalela, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nyenie akiilongoi ba Akayahudi ngabannengela mundu jwenio ojwalamiigwe, “Leleno nga lichoba lya kupomalela, kwa Malagilo gito chwapije kutola likai linu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jwombe ngabajanga, “Mundu ojwanamie ne nga jweno jwanengila ntole likai linu nnyabule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bombe ngabankonya, “Bene abannengi ntendi ganga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jweno ojwalamiigwe ammanyije mundu jweno ojwa nnamie, maana Yesu akiba abokite paali penia, pakiba na bandu ajingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kubokapenia, Yesu ngankolela jweno ojwa lamiigwe munyumba ja Nnoongo, nukunnengela, “Nnyoe, ngoe nnamite. Makatenda mabaja kabeje, manhwika kupatikana na chenge kilebe kibaja muno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mundu jweno ngajenda, ngabalengela achi ilongochi ba Akayahudi kutenda Yesu nga ojwanamie. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Magambu Yesu atenda kilebe chene lichoba lya Kupomalela, Akayahudi ngabatumbu kumpalapala. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Awawa bango bakamumaengo machoba goa, nane uyo ngamu maengo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Malobe ganga ngagatenda akiilongoi ba Akayahudi ngabapala ndela ja kunkoma Yesu. Bapalanga kunkoma magambu ga kualabia Malagilo ga lichoba lya Kupomolela tuje, ila magambu uyo akalenga kutenda Nnoongo nga Awamundu, na yenie ngakitenda tela na Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Uwecho gwa Mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nanenge kweli, Mwana kutendaje kilebe jikajakwe, aotwi kutenda chachetu chababona Awamundu bakatenda. Mana chache chabatenda Awawa na mwana uyo kutenda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Awawa kumpala mwana, nukunaya kila kilebe chabatenda bene. Mabannangila ilebe ikolongwa kupeta yenje, namangweto mpakuomongwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Andi yene Awawa kayoya abawile na kapeganga bwomi, uyo na Mwana kape bwomi baba abapaile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Awawa kuhukumulaje mundu jwajoa jola. Maengo goa ga hukumu bankamwie mwana, <verse number="23" style="v"/>na yene kupala bandu boa bannyali Mwana andi pabajali Awawa. Bangankolea Mwana kakoleaje Awawa abantumite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nannengelanga kweli, ojwajoa lilobe lyango, nukunhwamini jwajo ojwandumite, akweti bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. Ahukumigwaje, nambu apetite kuboka mukiu nukujingi mubwomi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, kingobu kitenda kuika, na kabe kiike, penia abawile mabajoa lilobe lya Mwana jwa Nnoongo, nabenia abapakujoa, mabalama. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Andi yene Awawa apababi kindumbutumbu cha bwomi, uyo pabampi kitoi Mwanagwabe kube kindumbutumbu cha bwomi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kabe bampi kinala chaka hukumu, kumagambu jwenio Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Makaomongwaje kilebe chenje. Kingobu kitenda kuika penia boa abawile mabajoa lilobe lyakwe, <verse number="29" style="v"/>na benia mabayoka, angweto abatendangite gambone bayoka nu kulama, na baba abatendangite mabaja mabayoka nu kuhukumigwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Machaili ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Ne kuotoje kutenda kilebe kuuwecho gwango namwene. Ne hukumula andi panyoa kuboka ka Awawa, na hukumu jango nga jakweli. Magambu mbala kutenda pambala namweneje, ila apabapala baba abandumite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Andi nikichalakicha na mwene, uchalakichi gwango ujeketiligwaje kube gwa kweli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu abi jonge ojwa njalakicha ne, ne manyi kutenda goa agalongela mialo jango ne nga ja kweli. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mangweto ngantuma nhwalo kwa Yohana, na jweno ngauchalakicha ukweli. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngati ne nhyobale kuchalakicha kwa bandu tuje, nambu nenga ikobo yenje ili mpatange ukomboligwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohana akiba anda lumuli, olujaka nu kung'ala, mangweto makibanga tayali kualalila kung'ala kweno kwa kingobu tu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nambu ne ngweti kuchalakicha kwango kukolongwa muno kuliko ogwapia Yohana. Kwamaana maengo aganagatenda, maengo agabambile Awawa nagatende, nga aganjalakicha kutenda Awawa nga abantumite. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Awawa benabo abantumite banjalakicha. Mangweto mpatangitije kujoa lilobe lyabe, wala kukubona kumio kwabe, <verse number="38" style="v"/>nu nhwalo gwabe kutamaje mumyojo jinu maana munhwaminingije ojwa bantumite. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mangweto nhwingikia Majandiko Machwapi, nkitangita kutenda nkatijabe mampatanga bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. Na Majandiko ugogo aganjalakicha! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Uyo, namangwetumwe mpailingije kuika kwangune mpatange bwomi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ne mbaije kupata kibumo kuboka ku bandu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetumwe numanyi, mangweto kupalaje Nnoongo mumyojuje. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ne nhike kwa amuli ja Awawa bango, nambu mangweto kumbokelangaje. Jonge mundu anda aike kwa amuli jakwe mwene, mamumpokela. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nhwotolangabo kuamini, na kongo mangweto mpalanga kupokelanga kibumo kuboka kwinu mmeni mangweto, wala mmikupalangaje chiipa kuboka kwabe bena ababi jika jabe Nnoongo. Lele nhwaminabo nenga? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Makakita ne manantakiana kwa Awawa. Musa jwombe mangweto mannhyobalela nga ojwa pa kuntakiana. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ikabi kweli munhwamini Musa, kabi nhwamininge na ne uyo, magambu Musa aandika minhalo jangone. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nambu magaaminingije gaga agaandike, miaminiangabo echi nikilongela?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu aupe chakulya nkengeni gwa bandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pa gena, Yesu ngajomboka lilaba Galilaya andaje lilaba Tibelia. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkenga nkolongwa gwa bandu ngugunkengama, kwa magambu bandu bena bakate kibona iingi yi ikobo eyatenda kalamianga akatamwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngaombe pikitombi, ngatama pamwe na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpapala gwa Akayahudi ejikemigwa Pasaka jakiba jiegalile. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bai Yesu apalola nukubona nkengeni gwa bandu apuika kwabe, ngankonya Filipo, “Tuemekoo chakulya ili bandu bamba bapatange kulyee?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Alenga nyenie kukunnyiga Filipo, gambu amaanyi mwene elya pakutenda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filipo ngannyanga, “Mikate ja ela denali mya mbili jatochangaje bandu bamba ata anda kila mundu jumwe aipata kipande kichokutu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jumwe jwa akinapunji bakwe ojwa kemigwa Andulea, nnung'una Simoni Petulo, ngannengela, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Abile pamba mwana jumwe ojwabi na mikate nhwano na yamaki ibele. Nambu yene itocha nike kwa bandu ajingi anda bamba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Matamikange bandu.” Pakiba na manyai nduu paali pena. Bai bandu ngabatamanga, bakibanga akina lome elufu nhwano. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngajitola mikate jenie, ngannumba Nnoongo, ngababaganikia bandu abakiba batamangite. Ngatenda uyo na yamakiye, kila mundu ngapata apapaile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bandu apabajukuta Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Nkongolange imbolopolo eiigile yakaobaje.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bai ngabakongolanga imbolopolo ya mikate eibaigiinge bandu bala abalilangita, ngabatweleyanga ikapo komi na ibena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bandu apabibona iingi yi ikobo yene yakatenda Yesu, ngabalenga, “Kweli jonjo nga Nnondoli ojwaika kudunia.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya bandu bapalanga kuntola abe nngwana, ngaboka kabele, ngajenda kukitombi jika jakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda panani ja mache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apiikiba kimuyo akinapunji bakwe ngabaelela mpaka kulilaba, <verse number="17" style="v"/>lubendu lukiba lutandite na Yesu akiba tango anaikaje ngabaombela ntumbwi bajomboke kujenda ku Kafalanaumu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kingobu tu upepo nkolongwa ngutumbu kuguguma nu kutimbugana mache. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akinapunji apabakiba bajendangite kwa maili nhwano au sita, ngaba mmona Yesu akajenda panani ja mache, apaubandakila ntumbwi, ngabajogopanga muno. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nga nenga, makajogopangaje!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bai ngabapala kuntola Yesu muntumbwi, na mangobu ugo ntumbwi nguika kujomo pabakiba bakajendanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bampalanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Malabu jakwe nkengeni gwa bandu guigi kwiye ngabamanya pakiba na ntumbwi gumwe tu penia, na Yesu ajingije muntumbwi pamwe na akinapunji bakwe, ila akinapunji bena bakibanga bajendangita jika jabe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mitumbwi jenge kuboka Tibelia ngijiika paali pena pabalya mikate bandu Angwana pabajomola kunnumba Nnoongo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bai bandu bena apabamanya Yesu na akinapunji bakwe bakibangaje paali pena, ngabaombela ntumbwi, ngabajabula kukafalanaumu kunkengama Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkate gwa bwomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bandu bena apabankolela Yesu upandi gonge gwa lilaba ngabankonya, “Aboli, nhwikila like pamba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Kweli nannengelanga, umbalanga kwa magambu nnilangite mikate ngannyukuta, ngiti gambu mibweni iingi yi ikobo yangoje. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mukikibegelelaje chakulya chikialabika, mikibegelele chakulya chikilama cha bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. Mwana jwa Mundu ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo, Awawa ampaganga chakulya chene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Benia ngabankonya, “Tutendi nike kwa gaga gapala Nnoongo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Lende nga liengo elyapala Nnoongo, kunhwamini ojwantumite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngabannengela, “Mpakutenda ikobo nike kupala tibone tunhwamini? Mpakutenda nike? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Akaoko bito ngabalye chakulya echikikemigwa manna kweno kupongoti, anda apagalenga Majandiko Machwapi, ‘Ngabape kulyee nkate kuuluka kumbengu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nannengela kweli, Musa ampilingitije nkate kuuluka kumbingu. Awawa bango nga abampe mangweto nkate gwa kweli kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Maana nkate gwa Nnoongo nga jwajo ojwauluka kuboka kumbengu nga ojwaupe bwomi kwa bandu pa dunia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngabannyopa, “Angwana, mutupe nkate gweno machoba goa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nenga nga chakulya echichimpe bwomi. Ojwaika kwango ne abeje na njala, ojwaamini abeje na nyota ngu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lele, nannengelinge nng'anwa umonangite nambu nhwaminije. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Boa abambi Awawa mabaika kwango ne. Nane ninekeje panja mundu jwajoa ojwaika kwangone, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nhike kuboka kumbengu ngati magambu ga ukamu ilebe yangoje, ila kulenganakia pabapala Awawa abandumite. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na apabapala abo abandumite nga ganga, nakanhwoyaje ata jumwe kati baba abambile, ila kapeganga boa bwomi gwangapela maninnyoya mulichoba lya mwicho. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Maana Awawa bango nga echibapala kila ojubammona Mwana nukunhwamini abe na bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, nane maninnyoya mulichoba lyu kujomolela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ngabatumbu ukokaleka Yesu magambu alengite, “Ne nga nkate oguulwike kuboka kumbengu.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ngabalenga, “Bo, ojo Yesu mwana jwa Yusufuje? Tamanyi awamundu na amamundu. Bai aotobo kulongela aulwike kuboka kumbengu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nkotokange ukokaleka mangweto jika. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwaotola kuika kwangone panga Awawa abandumite kunhwuta kuika kwangone, nane manunhyoya mundu jwenio lichoba lya mwicho. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Akalondoli baandikinge, ‘Bandu boa mababoligwa na Nnoongo.’ Mundu jwajoa ojwabajoine Awawa na kukibola kuboka kwabe kuika kwango ne. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Echinenga nga chenje, abije mundu oju babweni Awawa, ila jwajo ojwabokite kwa Nnoongo, jwenio nga ojubamweni Awawa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, mundu ojwaamini akweti bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ne nga chakulya chichampe bwomi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Akinaota binu ngabalye mana kweno kumpongoti, nambu ngabajomokanga. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nambu chenje nga chakulya kichiuluka kuboka kumbengu ili jwajoa ojwapakulye ajomokaje. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ne nga chakulya china bwomi echikiulwike kuboka kumbengu. Mundu jwajoa anda alile chakulya chenje, aitama nukupelaje. Na chakulya echimbakumpe nga mmele gwango, ogunuboya ibe bandu boa ba padunia babe na bwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ngapenia Akayahudi ngabatumbu kutaukana kati jabe, “Aotobo jonjo kutupe mmele gwakwe tulye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nannenge kweli, anda nukulyeje mmele gwa Mwana gwa Mundu nu kunywe myai jaakwe, mmegangaje na bwomi nkati jiinu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ojwalye mmele gwango nukunywe myai jango akweti bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, nane manuhyoya lichoba lyu kujomolela. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mana mmele gwango nga chakulya cha kweli, na myai jango nga chikunywe cha kweli. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ojwaulye mmele gwango na kujinywe myai jango, atama nkati jango, na ne ndama nkati jaakwe. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Andi Awawa pababi amomi bandumite, nane nama kumagambu ga benia. Uyo mundu ojwandye nenga aba kube mmomi uyo kumagambu gangone. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Bai chenje nga chakulya echikiulwike kuboka kumbengu, ngiti andi mana yabalya akinaota bitoje, ngabaweganga. Ojwalye chakulya chenje aba mmomi gwangapela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu alenga genia pakiba akapundicha munyumba jukugongale kwako kukilambo cha Kafalanaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malobe agaleta bwomi gwangapela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Ajingi ba akinapunji bakwe apabajoa genia, ngabalenga, “Mapundicho ganga gukujundupa! Bene abapakuotola kugapenikia?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya nukunnengeje mundu kutenda akinapunji bakwe ngabang'ing'iyana kukilebe chenie, ngabakonya, “Bo, kilebe chenje kimmekite mmegange na mbwele? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Ibakubebo pampakummona Mwana jwa Mundu akaombila kujenda kwako kwakiba? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Uhuke jwa Nnoongo ngaojwaleta bwomi, makakala ga mundu kuoto kileje. Malobe ganannengilaga nga ga Uhuke jwa Nnoongo, na galeta bwomi. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Iganu kube nyene babile kati jiinu bangaamini.” Yesu alenga nyene amanyi kuboka apitumbulaga beneke bangaamini, uyo na amanyi beneke abapa kung'aluka. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngalenga kabele, “Ngakwamana nanengilinge abije jwa otwile kuika kwango nukunhwotoya Awawa bangoje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kuboka mugenia, akinapunji bakwe ajingi ngababuja unyuma nu kulongwana kabeje. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya baba akinapunji bakwe komi na abena, “Bo, namangwetomwe mpala kuboka uyoyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo nganyanga, “Angwana, tupakujenda kubeneke? Mwe nkweti malobe agaleta bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Twe tuamini, nu tumanyi mwe nga Machwapi ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo, nanchagulingeje mangweto komi nabena? Iganu kube nyene, jumwe jiinu nga Mmaja!” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Yesu alongela genia magambu ga Yuda, mwana jwa Simoni Isikalioti. Maana jwenio akiba ngajweno ojwa pakunng'aluka, iganukube akiba jumwe jwa baba akinapunji komi na abena.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na inuna yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kibokachapena, Yesu ngajenda okwo kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya. Apaije kujenda kukilambo cha Yudea magambu akilongoi ba Akayahudi bakiba bapaila kunkoma. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpapala gwa Akayahudi ogukemigwa iteba, ukiba ubandikile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bai inuna yakwe nginnengela, “Mmoke pamba nnyende Kuyudea ili akinapunji binu bagabone maengo ga ntenda. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mundu ukamulaje maengo gakwe kukuiya anda apala kumanyika na bandu. Yene nkamu ilebe yene, mikilaye kwa bandu boa.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ata inuna yakwe yunhwaminije.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngabalengela, “Kingobu chango chanaikaje. Nambu kwinu mangweto kila kingobu cha mbone. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bandu boa kunchimwaje mangweto, nambu ne kunjimwa kwa magambu nenga, njalakicha benia bandwa itendwa yabe ibaja. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mangweto nnyendange ku mpapala gwenio. Ne nyendaje ku mpapala gwenio magambu kingobu chango chambone chanaikaje.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alenga genia kimoka chapenia ngaigala kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kusikukuu ja iteba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuboka pa inunu yakwe kujenda kusikukuu, najwombe Yesu ngajenda kusikukuu kwa kukiia. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Akilongoi ba Akayahudi bakibanga kumpala kusikukuu jene, ngabakonyanga, “Abiko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pakiba na indondo ijingi pankengeni gwa bandu. Bange ngabalenga, “Nga mundu jwambone.” Na bange ngabalenga, “Baoyanga bandu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu akibaje mundu ojwajigite kulenga nhwalo gwenio gwa Yesu pabandu kwa kajobokanga akilongoi ba Akayahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpapala gwenio pagwaba panakati na kati, na jweno Yesu ngajabu kunyumba ja Nnoongo, ngatumbu kupundicha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akilongoi ba Akayahudi ngabaomongwa na kulenga, “Mundu ojo apatita ko ilimu kiti atekuchoma chuleje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngajanga, “Mapundicho gambundicha gangoje nambu gabe benia abandumite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu andapai kutenda gaga gapai Nnoongo, mamanya mapundicho gango gaboka kwa Nnoongo, au ne ndenda kulongetu namwene. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mundu jwa kilonge mwene apala kunnumbalila mundu mwene. Nambu jwa pala kibumo cha abatumite, jwenio nga kuaminika, na nkati jakwe ubije ubaja gwa gwoa gola. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bo, Musa ampilingitije Malagilo? Ata yene, abije wala jumwe kwinu ojwa kamu malagano mpa kungomilanga nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia bandu ngabanyanga, “Mwe nkweti nchepela! Bene abapa kunkoma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Natendite kikobo chimwe, na mangweto ntenda kuomongwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musa ampilingite lukobo lwalo lukuina. Ngiti lukobo lwenio luboka ku Musaje nambu luboka kwa akaokolo nambu ngoe mangweto kuwina mwana munalome ata Lichoba Lya Kupomolela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bai anda ibi yene mwana munalome kuwina Lichoba Lya Kupomolela kwa magambu Malagilo ga Musa gakaponiaje, mbona lele unjimwalanga magambu ga kunnamia mundu kube tegatega lichoba lya kupomalela? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Makahukumu ilebe panjatuje, mpanganga hukumu ejipaligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bo jwenio nga Kilisto?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bange bandu ba Kuyelusalemu ngabalenga, “Bo mundu jwajo jubampala kunkomajo jwajoje? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nnolange ngoe! Alongela pukongolou, wala abije mundu ojwannenge kilebe. Bo, au akiilongoi bamanyi jwenio nga Kilisto? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kilisto papakuika abije mundu jwapa kumanya aboke koo. Nambu twe tumanyi kwaboka mundu ojo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bai Yesu pakiba akapundichaga unyumba ja Nnoongo ngatondobea lilobe nu kulenga, “Mmanyangite ne na mukumanyi kumoka? Ne inkila ku amuli jango namweneje. Ila abo abandumite ne nga ba kweli, na mangweto mumanyije. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu ne nummanyi kumagambu moka kachakwe, jwenio nga ojwandumite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bai bandu bapala kumeka mumakakala, nambu akibaje mundu ojwajigite kunkamula kumagambu kingobu chakwe kikiba tango chanaikaje. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ajingi abakiba pankenga pala bunhwamininge, ngabalenganga, “Bo, andaike Kilisto matenda ikobo ikolongwa muno kupeta yatei ojo?”</para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli gatumigwa kunkamula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mafalisayo gajowine bandu bakajojela malobe genia ga Yesu. Bai angweto pamwe na Akakung'i akolo ngabagakinga manjolinjoli gammeke Yesu mumakakala. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Tango mbi namangweto kingobu tu kubokapenia mbakunyendelela jwajo jwandumite. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mpakumbala nambu umonangaje, magambu papa pambakube namangweto kuotoje kuika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Achilongochi ba Akayahudi ngabalonge bene kangweto kwa angweto, “Mundu ojo apa kujenda ko pangaoto kumpata? Apakujenda kukilambo cha Akagiliki kubabi bandu bito na kapundicha Akagiliki? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Abi na mana gani palenga, ‘Mpakumbalanga nambu umbataje, na pamba kube ne mangweto kuotoje kuika?’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Chembwe cha mache ga bwomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lichoba lya kupela mpapala gwenio ngilikiba likolo, Yesu ngajema ngalenga kulilobe likolongwa, “Mundu ojwabi na nyota aiche kwango anywe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Andi Majandiko Machwapi pagalenga, ‘Mundu ojwaamini ne, chembwe cha mache agaleta bwomi gaba kueluka kuboka umojo jakwe!’ ” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Alenga genia kunenga Uhuke ba Nnoongo pikiba kube kwababala abanhwamini mabakipokela. Kingobu chenie Uhuke ba Nnoongo kikiba tango kuwika kwa magambu Yesu akiba tango anakoigwaje mukingwana.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupwilikana kwa bandu kwa magambu gwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bandu bange ababi pankenga pala ngabajoa malobe genia, ngabalenga, “Kweli mundu ojo nga nnondoli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabalenga, “Ojo nga Kilisto Nkomboi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu bange ngabalenga, “Bo, kube Nkomboi aboke kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Majandiko Machwapi galenga bole? Galenga, “Kilisto aboka kulungolo lwa nngwana Daudi, na apakubelekwa ku Beteleemu kilambo cha nngwana Daudi.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yene ngukupitila kupwilikana panakati jankengeni gwa bandu magambu ga Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Bandu bange bapala kummeka mumakakala, nambu akibaje mundu jwajigite kunkamula.</para>
  <para style="s">Akiilongoi ba Akayahudi bakwetije imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuboka penia manjolinjoli ngagabuja, akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo ngabakonya, “Ku nike mannetangiteje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli ngagajanga, “Abije mundu ojwa akalongela andi palongela mundu ojo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngagakonya, “Bo, namangwetomwe uyo nkoloigwe? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Bo, mummanyije ata kilongoi jumwe au Mfalisayo jwajote jwombe munhwamini? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nambu nkengeni gongo umanyije Malagilo ga Musa kwa nyene ulanigwe na Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Jumwe kati ja Mafalisayo akiba Nikodemo, jwenio atumbwi kunyendelela Yesu. Jwenio ngabalengela, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Bo, Malagilo giito gutujeketela kuhukumu mundu tango nukunnyoaje nu kumanya gatendite?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Angweto ngabanyanga kukunkonya, “Bo, namwe uyo mmoka kukilambo cha Ku Galilaya? Aja makagaingikiye Majandiko Machwapi namwe mannola Ku Galilaya kubokeje nnondoli ngu!” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kuboka penia bandu boa ngabajabula, kila mundu kachakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Munkege bunhumbwi ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngajenda kukitombi chikikemigwa Mizeituni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe kindabi tango kilokilo ngajenda kabele ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo. Bandu boa ngabantindilanga, jwombe ngataama ngatumbu kapundichanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akaboli ba Malagilo na Mafalisayo ngabannetela munkege ojubampuki akatenda ngongola. Ngabanyemeka panakati jabe, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kuboka penia ngabankonya Yesu, “Apundichi, munkege ojo tampuki akatenda ngongola. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mumalagilo giito, Musa atupundicha munkege ojwa tunhubwile ugoni andi jonjo aputigwe maganga mpaka kuwe. Mwe nnenga bo?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Balenga yene kuntegela Yesu ili bapatange kunkopakea. Nambu Yesu ngalita ngaandika pae nu lukonji. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pabajendekea kunkonya, Yesu ngajinuka, ngabalengela, “Mundu jwajoa katijinu jwanga majambi abe ju kutumbula kumputa munkege ojo liganga.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngalita kabele, ngabe akaandika pae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pabajoa yene ngabatumbu kubokanga jumwe jumwe, balongalela akinanhota. Yesu ngaika jikajaakwe, nu munkegejo ajemite upapa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu pajinuka ngankonya munkegejo, “Banduba babiko? Bo, aigije wala jumwe jukunhukumu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngajanga, “Angwana, abije wala jumwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngannenge, “Nane nunhukumuje. Nnyabule, namakatenda kabeje malemwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lumuli lwa padunia pano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu palongela nabo kabele ngabalenge, “Nenga nga lumuli lwa padunia pano. Mundu jwajoa ojwangengama nenga atyanga ngu mulubendu, ila apakube pa lumuli lwa bwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngagannenge, “Mwe mukichalakicha mmene, nayene uchaili gwinu gwambonije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Ataikabi nikichalakicha namwene, uchaili gwango gwa kweli kumagambu nenga manyi kumoka na kunyenda. Nambu mangweto mukumanyije kumoka wala kunyenda. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mangweto nhukumu kwa mawacho ga mundu tu, nambu ne kunhukumu munduje. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nambu ata nakanhukumwile, hukumu jango ja kweli magambu mbi jikajangoje. Awawa abandumite babi pamwe na ne. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iandikigwe Mumalagilo giinu uchaili gwa bandu abele nga kweli ogujeketiligwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ne nikichalakicha namwene, na Awawa abandumite, batenda kunjalakicha uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Penia ngabankonya, “Awawa binu babiko?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabajanga, “Mangweto umanyije ne nawala Awawa mamanyije. Makamanyi nenga kabi mamanyi Awawa baango uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu alongela malobe genia goa apakiba akapundicha munyumba ja Nnoongo, muchumbi chukupanga lilumbo. Naakibaje mundu jukummeka mumakakala kumagambu kingobu chakwe kikibataango kuika.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunyenda mangweto kuotoje kuika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge kabele, “Mwanja na maumbalanga, nambu mpakujomoka namabaja ginu. Kunyenda nenga, mangweto kuotoje kuika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bai akilongoi ba Akayahudi ngabalenga, “Bo, apakikikoma? Mboni alenga, ‘Kunyenda mangweto kuotoje kuika?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mangweto mmokanga upamba pae, nambu nenga mmoka kunani. Mangwetomwe mapadunia pano, nambu nenga napadunia panoje. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Magambu nannengila mangweto mpakujomoka mumabaja ginu. Anda nukuaminije kutenda, ‘Ne nga jwenio.’ Mpakujomoka na mabaja ginu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Angweto ngabankonya, “Mwe mabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabajanga, “Nannengalinge kuboka pukutumbula! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ngweti majingi gukulongela nu gukunhwukumula. Nambu jwajo ojwandumite nga kweli, nane nijilenge dunia ilebe yae tu inijoa kuboka kwabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bamanyangiteje Yesu akiba alongelanabo kunhwalo gwa Awawa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngabalengela, “Pampakunyinula Mwana jwa Mundu, penia nga pampa kumanya kutenda ‘Ne nga Nenga’. Na ndendaje kilebe namwene, ila nongela gagatu gabambundicha Awawa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Baba abandumita babi pamwe nane, benia banekiteje jika yene ngamu ndenda mangobu goa gaga gabaalali mojo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuboka pukulenga genia bandu ajingi ngabaamini.</para>
  <para style="s">Kweli jipakummeka mme agabwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngabalengela Akayahudi baba ababunhwamini, “Anda magaagabile mapundicho gango mmaganga makinapunji bango kweli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mpakujimanya kweli, na kweli jipakummeka agabwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Angweto ngabanyanga, “Twe twalungolo lwa Ulaimu, ngu tanabeje takabanda ba mundu jwa jwoa jola. Mmi namana gani pannenga mma kube agabawa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Nannenge kweli, kila mundu ojwatenda mabaja nga mmanda jwa mabaja. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mmanda akwetije kitamo cha machoba goa pakaja, nambu mwana akweti kitamo cha machoba goa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anda Mwana ampilingite agabwa mmakube kweli agabwa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Maanyi mangweto malungolo lwa Ulaimu. Ata yene mpakungoma kumagambu mmikugajeketelaje mapundicho gango. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ne nongela gaga gabanangila Awawa, nambu mangweto ntendanga gaga gabannenge awabinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Angweto ngabanyanga, “Awawa bito Ulaimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengela, “Ikabi mangweto makinangota ba Ulaimu kabi ntei andi patenda Ulaimu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ne nannengile kweli gunujoa ku Nnoongo nambu mangweto mpala kungoma. Ulaimu atenda yeneje! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mangweto ntendanga ilebe uyaye ibatenda awawa binu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Angweto ngabannengela, “Twe takanangota ba mumatutweje tukweti awawa bamwe yani Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Ikabi Nnoongo nga awawa binu, kabi umbaile ne, mana ne mmoka ku Nnoongo na ngoe mbi pamba. Nkila kumadalaka gango namweneje ila benia abandumite. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kunike kumanyaje ganongela? Kumagambu kuotoje kujoa nhwalo gwango. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe makinangota ba Mmaja na mpalanga ukengama ga awawa binu. Benia bakiba akomi kuboka paitumbalaga, bakwetije kijemo cha kweli, na yene kweli jibije nkati jabe. Kila apabalenga uwangi, balonge mukuboke muali jabe tangu apatumbalaga, mana benia awangi na awawa ba uwangi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ne nonge kweli, nga kwamana mangweto kuaminije. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bene kati jinu abanjalakicha ne ngweti mabaja? Anda nonge kweli mboni kunhwaminije? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ojwabi jwa Nnoongo kupenakia malobe ga Nnoongo. Nambu mangweto kupenakiaje kumagambu mangwetomwe mabanduje ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akiba tango Ulaimu nukubeje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Akayahudi ngabankonya Yesu, “Bo, tulengiteje kweli mwe makabila ja Samalia, na kabe mmi nanchepela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Ne ngwetije nchepela, ne naamini Awawa bango, nambu mangweto kuaminije ne. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ne kupalaje kibumo chango namwene. Abile jumwe ojwapala kibumo chenie, Nnoongo nga ojwanumbane, jwombe nga hakimu. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, ojwabegelela na mapundicho gango ajomokaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ngabalenga, “Ngoe tumanyi kweli mwe nkweti nchepela! Ulaimu ngawe, na akalondoli booa ngabawe, namwe nnenga eti, ojwabegelela na mapundicho ginu aweje mpaka! <verse number="53" style="v"/>Bo mikitenda makolongwa kapeta Awawa bito Ulaimu nambu bombe bajomwike? Na ata akalondoli bajomwike Mwe mitenda babeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Anda nikikoite namwene, kibumo chango kilebeje, ne mbata kibumo Kawawa bango. Bombe mangweto makema ana Nnoongo binu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe mamanyije, nambu ne namanyi, andannengite namanyije, mamba nawangi andi mangweto. Ne namanyi na mbikamula nhwalo gwabe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ulaimu, Awawa binu, ngabalulutila bilibone lichoba lyango, bombe ngabalibona, ngababe ngalaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ngabannengela, “Mwe tango manaikaje yaka amsini nnengabo kutenda mumweni Ulaimu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nannenge kweli, tango Ulaimu nukubelekwaje ne mbile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Penia ngabalokota maganga ili bannekelele, nambu Yesu ngakiia, ngapita munyumba ja Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu anamia Mundu ojwa belwike Jwangalola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akapeta ngammona mundu jumwe, jwangalola kuboka pabelekwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bai akinapunji ngabankonya, “Aboli, ngabeneke abatei mabaja jwombe mwene au amamundu na awamundu mpaka mundu ojo abelekwe jwangalola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Kile chene chapiti kwa magambu ga mabaja gakweje na wala mabaja ga akapotoi bakwe. Ila abelwike jwangalola ili makakala ga Nnoongo gabonekane gakakamu maengo nkati jakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Anda kubi tango nalumu tupaligwa kujendekea ukamwa maengo ga baba abandumite, maana kilo kitenda kuika peni mundu aotwaje ukamwa maengo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mangobu mbi kudunia, ne nga lumuli lwa kudunia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuboka pukulonge genia, Yesu ngauna mata pae, ngaunya mandope, ngampakaya jweno jwangalola mumio, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ngannengela, “Nnyendi makakuye mulilaba lya Siloamu.” (Siloamu maana jakwe, “abatumigwe.”) Penia jweno jwangalola ngajenda, ngakuya, kubokapenia ngabuja abi akalola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bai andamya ajabe na baba abakiba bumanyi jweno akiba nhwocho kijopajopa, ngabalenga, “Bo, ojo jwajoje nhwocho na kijopajopa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bange bandu ngabalenga, “Ujojo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bange ngabalenga, “Je, ila atekulandana.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu jweno ojwaakabe jwangalola ngalenga, “Nga nenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bai ngabankonya, “Lele, mio ginu gawekuka bo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na jweno ngabajanga, “Jwajo mundu ojwakemigwa Yesu akatenda mandope, ngambakaya kumio na nganengela, ‘Nnyabu makakuye mulilaba lya Siloamu.’ Penia, ne nganyenda, nganguya, ngambata kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngabankonya, “Jweno abikole?”</para>
  <para style="p">Najweno ngabajanga, “Ne manyije!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo gaingakia kulama kwa jwangalola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngabampeleka mundu jweno ojwakiba jwangalola kwa Mafalisayo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lichoba lyene Yesu apaunya mandope na kuweku mio mundu jweno, lyakiba Lichoba Lya Kupomolela. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bai Mafalisayo ngabankonya kabele mundu jweno, “Mpatitabo kulola?” Na jweno ngabalengela, “Ambakia mandope mumio, na ne nganguya na ngoe mbikulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bange Mafalisayo ngabalenga, “Mundu ojo aboka ku Nnoongoje, gambu kuagabaje Malagilo gi Lichoba li Kupomolela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu bange ngabalenga, “Mundu juna mabaja aotobo kulaya iingi yi ikobo andi yenje?” Ngapabe nu kupwilikana kati jabe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngabankonya kabele mundu jweno ojwakiba jwangalola, “Nnenga anamie mio ginu, chwapi, mwe nnongebo kwa jweno?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jweno ngabalengela, “Jweno nga nnondoli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Akilongoi ba Akayahudi baaminingeje mundu jweno akiba jwangalola tangu kubelekwa kwakwe na ngoe atenda kulola, mpaka apabakema achikibelei bakwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bai ngabakonya benia achikibelei bakwe, “Bo, jonjo nga kakombo jwinu jwombe mangweto nnenga akabelekwa jwangalola? Ngoe alamitabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Achikibelei bakwe ngabajanga, “Tumanyi jonjo mwanajwito, na abelwike jwangalola. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu tumanyije apalamita, na tumanyije jwajo ojwanhwekwi mio. Munkonya mwene, jwenio munanhota, aotwile kulongela mwene.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Achikibelei bakwe balenga nyenie kwa magambu batenda kujogopanga akikilongoi ba Akayahudi magambu akikilongoi bena bakiba bapataninge kutenda mundu jwajote ojwapa kunyeketela Yesu nga Kilisto bapakumenga panja ja nyumba ja kugongalela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nga maana achikibelei bakwe ngabalenga, “Jweno mundu munaota, munkonyanga mwene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bai ngabankema kabele jweno ojwakiba jwangalola, ngabannenge, “Mumpe kibumo Nnoongo! Twe tumanyi mundu jonjo jwannamia nga juna mabaja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Jweno ngajanga, “Anda nga juna mabaja ne manyije. Nambu kilebe chimwe nikimanyi, nakiba nangalola, na ngoe ndenda kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bai ngabankonya, “Bantendi nike? Bunhwekwibo mio ginu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mundu jweno ngabajanga, “Nyomwi nganannengelanga, na mangweto manyoineje. Kwa nike mpala kumbenikia kabele? Bo, mangweto mpala kube akinapunji bakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu bena ngabantukana nu kulenga, “Mwe nga manapunji bakwe, nambu twe nga akinapunji ba Musa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Twe tumanyi Nnoongo alongi na Musa, nambu mundu jonjo tummanyije abokita ko!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mundu jweno ngabajanga, “Chene nga kilebe cha kuomongwa! Mangweto mmanyije abokita ko, nambu anhwekwi mio gango! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tumanyi Nnoongo kapenikiangaje bandu bina mabaja, ila ampenikia jwajote ojwannumba na kulenganakia agapala Nnoongo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tangu kutumbwa kwa dunia tanajoaje mundu agawekwile mio ga mundu ojwabelwike Jwangalola. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Anda mundu jonjo akabokitije kwa Nnoongo, kabi aotwije kutenda chachoa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Bena ngabannyanga, “Mwe ngammelekwa na kunnela mumabaja, nhwotobo kutubola twenga?” Bai ngabammenga munyumba.</para>
  <para style="s">Jwangalola cha kiuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngajoa, bakate kummenga munyumba ja Nnoongo bai apankolela jwangalola ngankonya, “Bo, mwe muamini Mwana jwa Mundu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu jweno ngajanga, “Angwana, unengele bena beneke, ili mbate kaamini.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengala, “Mamweni, najweno nga ojwalonge na mwe ngoe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Bai mundu jweno ngakilikitila ngalenga, “Angwana amini!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Nenga ikila kuhukumu dunia, ibe bangalola bapatange kulola, na abalola babegange bakalolaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bange Mafalisayo abakiba pamwe nabo ngabajoa malobe gena, ngabankonya, “Bo nnenga natwe tangalola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Anda makabi bangalola, kabi mmilingitije na malemwa. Nambu ngoe mangweto nnenga, ‘Twe tubikulola, na nyenie ibonekana mmi tango na mabaja.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa achungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Nannenge kweli, jwajoti jola jwangajingila mukitundu cha mambelele kwa kukupetela panniango, nambu kupekenyela na kujingila kwa ndela jenge, jwenio nga nnyibi na mpoki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nambu mundu ojwajingila kukupetela paniango, jwenio nga nchungi jwa mambelele. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnendei jwa niango gwa kitundu kunnyogolela nchungi, na mambelele kujoa lilobe lyakwe, na benia kagakema mambelele gabe kila limwe kwa liina lyakwe, na kugalongolea panja. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Anda agapiite panja, na genia mambelele kunkengama, mana gamaanyi lilobe lyabe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mambelele genia gaotwije kunkengama nng'eni, ila gapakuntila kwa magambu galimanyije lilobe lyabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengelanga kulandanikia kweno, nambu benia bamanyije echapala kalengelanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nchungi jwa mbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngalenga kabele, “Nannenge kweli, ne nga nniango gwa mambelele. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bange bala boa abaike nnongi jango nga akajibi na akapoki, nabenia mambelele gapenikije. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ne nga nniango. Ojwajingi kwa kupete kwango ne maikomboligwa. Maijingila na kupita, nu kupata lulela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nnyibi kuika kwa magambu ga kujiba, ukoma na kualabiya. Ne inkila mpate kube na bwomi, bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nenga nanchungi jwa mbone. Nchungi jwambone kuboya bwomi gwakwe magambu ga mambelele gakwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu jwa kibalua jwombe nchungije, na wala mambelele mali gakweje, apalola limei lyakaika, kagaleka mambelele nukutila, kubokapenia limei kagapukila na mambelele kupwilikana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Jweno kugajalije mambelele kwa magambu jweno nga mundu jwa nchaala tu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nenga nachungi bambone. Nagamanyi mambelele gango, na genia gamanyi ne, <verse number="15" style="v"/>anda nyenie Awawa apabamanyi ne, nane apanamanyi Awawa. Nenga nuboya bwomi gwango kwa magambu ga mambelele. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kabele ngweti mambelele gange gangabe mukitundu chenje. Mbaligwe kagaleta nagenia, nagenia magalijoa lilobe lyango, na mapaba na kipenga chimwe na nchungi jumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Awawa bambaile ne mana nuboya bwomi gwango mbate kuupokela kabele. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwa amboka bwomi gwango. Ne nuboya kwa iyali yango namwene. Ngweti kinala chu kuboya ni kinala chu kutola kabele. Nyene ngipibi Awawa apabaamuliche ndende.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ngukube kabe kupwilikana kati ja Akayahudi kwa magambu ga malobe genia. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ajingi ngabalenga, “Akweti nchepela, kabe nga machonjo! Ga nike kumpenikia?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bange ngabalenga, “Ganga malobe ga junanchepelaje. Bo, nchepela kuotola kagaeku mio ga bangalola?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akaanigwa na Akayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kweno Kuyelusalemu kukiba na chikukuu jukubeka chwapi nyumba ja Nnoongo. Mangobu gena gakiba ga malili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jwombe Yesu ngabe akajenda munyumba ja Nnoongo panchana gwa Solomoni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ngabantindila, ngabankonya, “Mpakutuleka nambwele mpaka lii? Anda mwe nga Kilisto, bai, mutulengele kipola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nannengelinge, nambu kuaminije. Maengo aga nagatenda ne kwa liina lya Awawa bango gatenda kunjalakicha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu mangweto kuaminije magambu mangweto mambelele ganguje. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mambelele gango kulijoa lilobe lyango. Nenga nagamanyi, nagena kungengama. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nenga nampeganga bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela, na benia baobangaje machoba goa, wala abije mundu ojwa pakugaotola kagaboya mukuboko jango. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Awawa bango bombe ngaba mbila gena nga kolongwa kuliko boa, wala abije ojwapakuotola kagaboya mukuboko jabe Awawa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nenga na Awawa, tubi jumwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ngabatolanga maganga kabele ili bamputange. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nannangilinge maengo majingi kuboka kwa Awawa. Nga gako kati ja ganga agantenda umbutange maganga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akayahudi ngabannyanga, “Kwamaengo gambone tumputaje maganga, ila magambu gukuntukana Nnoongo! Maana mikitenda mwe ma Nnoongo kongo mwe mamundu tu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo, iandikigweje Mumalagilo ginu, Nnoongo ngalenga, ‘Mangweto nga milongo?’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngajikema milongo baba abapatite malagilo gakwe, natwe tumanyi Majandiko Machwapi galenga ukweli machoba goa.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Awawa banyegwiye nu kunduma kudunia, kwa nike nnenga ndenda kutukana magambu nengite, ‘Nenga nga Mwana jwa Nnoongo?’ <verse number="37" style="v"/>Anda mbi ukamulaje maengo ga Awawa bango, makaaminije. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nambu andambi kamula, ata ikabi nhwaminingije, makabi kuamini oti maengo gena, mmanyange kutenda, Awawa bango babi nkatijango, nanenga mbi nkatijabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngabajiganga kabele kumpukila Yesu, nambu ngapokonyoka mumaboko gabe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngajabu kabele kwie ja lukemba Yolidani, paali apakiba Yohana akabatiza, ngatama kweno. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabannyendelela ngabalenga, “Yohana alaiteje iingi yi ikobo yayoa. Nambu gena goa Yohana agalenga gena magambu ga mundu jwenio ga kweli.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Paali penia bandu ajingi ngabanhwamini.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe ojwa konda Lazalo, ojwatama ku Betania, akiba ntamwe. Ku Betania kikiba kilambo echibatama Maliamu na Malita, akalombo mundu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Maliamu nga jweno ojwampakaya Angwana mauta nukunhwungula kwanywili yakwe. Lazalo nkakamundu ngaojwakiba ntamwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bai akalombo bena ngabatuma nhwalo kwa Yesu kutenda, “Angwana, nng'anjagwinu jwamampala ntamwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu pajoa yene, ngalenga, “Kitamwe chenje kiletaje kiu, nambu kumagambu ga kunkoya Nnoongo, alwalite kitamwe chenje kupala kumpe kibumo Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ngampala Malita na alombo mundu na Lazalo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paupata nhwalo gwenio Lazalo ntamwe, Yesu ngajendekea kutama paali upo kwa machoba mabele. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabalengela akinapunji baakwe, “Tujende kabele kukilambo cha Kuyudea!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabalengela, “Aboli! Kingobu kichokotu kipetite kuboka pa Akayahudi pabapala kunkoma na maganga, namwe mpala kujenda kabele kwenioko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo, kingobu cha mui komi ni ibeleje? Bai mundu anda atyangite mui kuotoje ukobala magambu alola ndaa padunia. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu mundu anda ajendite kilo apakobala kumagambu lumuli lubije nkati jaakwe.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu pajomola kulongela malobe genia, ngabalengela, “Ng'anjagwito Lazalo abi lugono, nambu ne manyenda kunyimuya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akinapunji baakwe ngannengela, “Angwana, anda abi lugono, bai malama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Angweto bapemelela Yesu alengita kugoche lugono, bamanyije alenga kiu cha Lazalo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngabalengela kipola, “Lazalo awile! <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu mbi na laa kumamagambu giinu, nakibaje na mangweto kwenio, na mpate kuamini. Aja, tujende kachakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tomasi ojwakemigwa Mabela ngabalengela akinapunji akajakwe, “Tujende na twe tukawee tuboa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuyoya na bwomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu pajenda kwenio ankolela Lazalo abi mulikabuli machoba ncheche. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kukijiji cha ku Betania kukiba papipi na kilambo cha Kuyelusalemu, kulipa kwakwe kubi kilomita itatu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akayahudi ajingi bakiba baike kwa Malita na Maliamu kakokalekea kukiu cha nkaka mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bai Malita pajoa Yesu atendakuika, ngajenda kumpokela, nambu Maliamu ngaika kachakwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Malita ngannengela Yesu, “Angwana, makabi upamba, Nhwacha gwito kabi ajomwikeje! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu maanyi mpaka ngoe chachoa cha mpa kunnenge Nnoongo, mampa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nhwacha gwinu mayoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Malita ngajanga, “Manyi mayoka mangobu ga kuyoka, lichoba lya kupela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nenga nga kuyoka na bwomi. Ojwaamini nenga ata akajomwike malama. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na kila ojwalama na kuamini nenga aweje ngu. Bo, kuamini genago?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Malita ngannengela, “Elo Angwana! Nenga amini mwenga nga Kilisto, Mwana jwa Nnoongo, jwajo ojwaika padunia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenda kuguta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bada ja kulenga genago, Malita ngajenda kunkema Maliamu nnombo mundu, ngannengela pantemela, “Mmoli abi pamba, ankema.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jwombe apajoa gena kingobucho ngajinuka, nukunnyendelela Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu akiba anajingije pikijiji, ila akiba tango paali upapa apampokila Malita. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi babakiba pamwe kachakwe Maliamu babakiba kumpe pole pabamona ajinwike nukupita panja chokwe, ngabankengama. Bakita akiba kujenda kamakabuli kulombola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bai Maliamu apaika paali pena apabi Yesu nukummona ngakilikitila, nukunnengela, “Angwana makabi upamba, akaka bango kabi bawije!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu apammona akaguta na Akayahudi babaika pamwe, nangweto uyo baguta, ngabe na chimbaa, na laaje kumwojo gwakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia ngabankonya, “Mammekiti ko?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabannyanga, “Angwana, nhwike nnole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngaguta. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Akayahudi ngabalenga, “Nnolange apampaile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nambu kati jabe ngabalenga, “Bo, jonjo nganhwekwi mio jwangalola jola, kuotoje kuntenda Lazalo akaweje?”</para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo atenda kuyoigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Bai Yesu akiba na laaje kabele kumwojo, ngaika kamakabuli likabuli lyene lyakiba nduka, liekiligwe kwa libwe! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mmoyange libwe lyene!”</para>
  <para style="p">Malita, nnombo mundu jwajo ojwawile, ngannengela, “Angwana, tayali atumbu kununga, atamite mulikabuli machoba ncheche!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Bo, nanengije anda nhwamini mamikibona kibumo cha Nnoongo?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bai ngabaliboya libwe lyene. Yesu ngalola kunani kumbingu, ngalenga, “Nanumba ma Awawa kwa magambu umbi kunyoa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Maanyi umbi kunyoa machoba goa. Nambu nengite genago magambu ga bandu ababi pamba bapate kuamini kutenda mwenga maundumite.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Apajomola kulenga genago, ngakema kwa lilobe likolongwa, “Lazalo! Mpite panja!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Jwajo ojwakiba ajomwike ngapita panja, kongo bantabite chanda mumakongono na mumaboko, nukumio jakwe kuwekeligwe. Yesu ngabalengela, “Mankulugule, manneke ajabule.”</para>
  <para style="s">Njama ja kunkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bai Akayahudi ajingi bakiba baike kwa Maliamu pabalola gena agatendite Yesu, ngaba nhwamini. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nambu kati jabe ngabajenda kwa Mafalisayo ngabape nhwalo gwa ikobo eyatendite Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo ngababe na machabuli makolongwa, ngabalenga, “Tutendi nii? Mundu jonjo alaya iingi yi ikobo nduu muno.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Nkung'i ju Kiyahudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Anda tunnekite tu bandu boa mabanhwamini, na Akaloma mabaika kualabia nyumba jito ja Nnoongo na kilambo chiito!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Pena jumwe kati jabe ojwakonda Kayafa, ojwabi nkung'i nkolo chaka chenie, ngalenga, “Mangwetumwenga, mmanyije kilebe! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Bo, mmikulolaje mbaya kwinu mundu jumwe awe kwa magambu ga bandu, kuliko kilambo choa.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Jweno alenga gena kwa iyali yakwe mweneje, ila magambu jwombe mwene akiba nkung'i nkolo chaka chene, ngalondola kita Yesu mawage magambu ga kilambo chakwe, <verse number="52" style="v"/>na kwa magambu gabetuje, nambu apate kuleta pamwe ingota ya Nnoongo abapwilikine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Bai tangu lichoba lyene achikilongochi ba Akayahudi ngababeka njama ja kunkoma Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kwagena Yesu atyangitije pakubonekana na Akayahudi, ila ngaboka pena, ngajenda paali papipi na mpongoti, pikilambo cha Kuefulaimu. Ngatama kweno pamwe na akinapunji bakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mpapala gwa Pasaka gwa Akayahudi gwakiba gubandakile, na bandu ajingi ngabajenda Kuyelusalemu bapaila bikijeguyange tango na mpapala gwenio gwanatumbuje. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Bai ngaba mpala Yesu, na pabakongana pamwe munyumba ja Nnoongo ngabakonyana, “Nnolabo? Ibonikana aikaje ku mpapala, andaje?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo bakiba bapiite amuli anda mundu apamanyi paali apabi Yesu balengele ili bampukile.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampakaya mauta Kubetania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Gakaigala machoba sita kube Mpapala gwa Pasaka, Yesu ngajenda kukilambo cha ku Betania kachakwe Lazalo ojwannyoya Yesu kuboka kwa abawile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kweno ngabampanganikia chakulya cha kimuyo, Malita akiba akatumika. Lazalo akiba pamwe nababa abakibanga pamecha pamwe na Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bai Maliamu ngatola chupa cha mauta gabei, ngampakaya Yesu mumakongono nukuungula kwa nywili yakwe. Unyumba mwoa nginungila luumba lumauta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bai Yuda Isikalioti, jumwe kati ja akinapunji komi na abena jwenio ojwapakung'aluka Yesu, ngalenga, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Kwanike mauta gena gauchigwije ku bei ngolongwa nu uloi gwene kape akaocho?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Alenga genia ngiti kaagaba akaochoje nambu magambu akiba mmeka ela, namagambu akiba mwihi, kwa machoba majingi akiba kujiba munkoba gweno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngalenga, “Makachumbuyaje amama bamba! Maleke bagabeke magambu ga lichoba lya machiko gango. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Akaocho mamma nabo machoba goa, nambu mmegangaje nane machoba goa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Njama ju kunkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Akayahudi ajingi ngabajoa Yesu akiba ku Betania. Bai ngabajenda kweno ngiti kumagambu gukummona Yesu tu, unyae bapate kumona Lazalo ojwanyoite Yesu kuboka kwa babawile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo ngabatenda njama jukunkoma Lazalo, <verse number="11" style="v"/>maana kumagambu ga Lazalo Akayahudi ajingi ngabagaluka achilongochi babe, ngabanhwamini Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajingi Kuyelusalemu niilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe, nkengeni gwa bandu abaika kusikukuu ngabajoa kube Yesu akiba undela kuika Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bai ngabatola makoti gi mitende, ngabajenda kumpokela kongo bakatondobea malobe nu kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Alumbigwe Nnoongo! Abe ni kindimba jwenio ojwapakuika ku liina lya Angwana.</para>
  <para style="q">Babe ni kindimba Angwana bu Kuisilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngampata mwana liponda jumwe ngaombela panani jakwe anda Majandiko Machwapi apagalenga, <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Makajobokaje, kilambo cha Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q">Nnole, Angwana binu batenda kuika,</para>
  <para style="q">anhwombi mwana liponda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie akinapunji bakwe bamanyingitije ile yene, nambu Yesu apakiba akoigwe, penia ngabakombakela genia gakiba gaandikigwe kunhwalo gwa jweno, na kutenda bandu bakiba bantendila genia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi babakiba pamwe nakwe mangobu apabankema Lazalo mulikabuli, nganhyoya kuboka kwa babawile, ngabachalakicha gagapitile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwagenia nkengeni gwa bandu ngujenda kumpokela, gambu boa ngabajoa kita Yesu alaite iingi yi ikobo yenie. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngabalengelana, “Mmikulola? Tuotwije kutenda chachoa! Nnolange bandu boa bankengama.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bandu ba kilambo cha Kiyunani bapala kummona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakiba na Akagiliki kati ja bandu babaika kuyelusalemu kugongalela mangobu ga mpapala gwenio. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Akangweto ngabannyendela Filipo, jwa kilambo chuku Betisaida kweno ku Galilaya, ngabalenga, “Angwana, tupala kummona Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filipo ngajenda, kunnengela Andulea, boa akabele ngabajenda kunnengela Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “mangobu gukoigwa Mwana jwa Mundu gaike! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, mbonje ya mapemba maigala mbonje tu nambu anda igwile pulundope nukuwe. Anda iwile ipambika mbonji ndu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu ojwapala bwomi gwakwe, abakuoya, nambu mundu ojwauchimwa bwomi gwakwe padunia jenje maubeka kumagambu ga bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ojwapala kundumikia mpaka angengame oti, magambu genia papotipala pambi nenga penia mpakachi jwango pabakube. Mundu jwajoa ojwandumikia, Awawa bango bapakunnyali jwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Ngoe mwojo gwango utenda kuwechuka, nongela nike? Bo, nenge, ‘Awawa, makakiluchuje kingobu chene kinhikalile?’ Nambu nhikila kwa magambu genia kupala mbete kingobu chukupotekigwa cheno. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Awawa, mulikoleye liina linu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Penia lilobe ngililenga kuboka kumbengu, “Nankoliye, na mbakulikoleya kabele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu gukiba ujemite peniapo ngabajoa lilobe lyene, na bange angweto ngabalenga, “Alonge na mpakachi jwa Nnoongo alonginago!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Lilobe lyenie lipitila kumagambu gangoneje, ila kumagambu ginu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ngoe nga kingobu cha dunia jeno kuhukumigwa, ngoe nkolongwa jwa dunia jeno apakupenduligwa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nane pambakujinuligwa kunani ja dunia mbakunhuta kila mundu kwango.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu alongela yene alaya apakuwe kiu gani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkenga gwenio ngugwannyanga, “Twe tulengaligwa na Malagilo giito kutenda Kilisto apakutama nukupelaje. Nhwotobo, bai kulenga eti Mwana jwa Mundu apakujinuligwa? Jwenio Mwana jwa Mundu nga meneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Lumuli lubi tango namangweto kuki ngobu kachoko. Nnyendange tango mminalo lumuli lwenio, ibe lubendu lukampataje, maana ojwajenda mulubendu kumanyaje kwajenda. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bai kingobu mminalo lumuli lwenio muluamini ili mpatange kube bandu bu lumuli.” Kuboka pa kulongela malobe genia, Yesu ngajabula nu kujoba kutaali na ngweto.</para>
  <para style="s">Bandu imanije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Iganukube Yesu akalaya iingi yi ikobo yenie nnongi jabe, angweto bunhwaminije. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yene lilobe lyalongila Nnondoli Isaya ngagatimia,</para>
  <para style="q">“Angwana, ngabene abaamini nhwalo gwito?</para>
  <para style="q">Na uwecho gwa Angwana ubonikini kubeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yene baotwije kuamini, na Isaya ngalenga kabele,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Nnoongo ateila babe injwilii mio gabe,</para>
  <para style="q">bateilinge ajinga,</para>
  <para style="q">bakalolangaje kwa mio gabe,</para>
  <para style="q">bakamanyaje kwa malango gabe,</para>
  <para style="q">na bakamujilangaje, alenga Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">kupa nalamiange.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isaya ngalenga malobe gena magambu ngakibona kibumo cha Yesu, ngalenga mialo jakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ata nyenie, akiilongoi ajingi ba Akayahudi ngabanhwamini Yesu. Nambu magambu ga Mafalisayo bannyeketilingije pukongolou kukujogopa kata kabenga muiteba yukugongalela. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bapala kupata kibumo ku bandu kuliko kupata kibumo na Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Lilobe lya Yesu lihukumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kiboka cha pena Yesu ngalenga kwa lilobe likolo, “Mundu ojwaamini nenga, aamini netuje, ila anhwamini ojwandumite. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ojwa amona nenga amona ojwandumite. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nenga nga lumuli, nane inke padunia pano ibe boa abaamini bakabe mulubenduje. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ojwagajoa malobe gango nambu kugakamulaje, nenga nunhwukumuje, maana ikila padunia kuhukumuje ila kukombola. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Jwanga gakamula malobe gango akweti jwa kunhwukumu. Lilobe lyale lyanongilage lela nga akimu jwabe lichoba lya kupela. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nenga nongila ku amuli jango namweneje ila Awawa abandumitage nga abaamulicha nonge nike na nengi nike. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nane manyi amuli jabe jileta bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. Bai neenga nenga gagatu gabanagila nenge.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bajelea makongono akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Likaiga lichoba limwe kube mpapala gwa Pasaka kujingila, Yesu ngamanya kube kingobu chakwe chukuboka padunia nukujenda kwa Awawa kiike. Akiba bapaile kila kingobu bandu bakwe ababi padunia bapailinge mpaka kupela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe bakiba batamite kulye ndalilo. Mmaja akiba anyeile Yuda, mwana jwa Simoni Isikalioti, mawacho ga kung'aluka Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu amanyi awamundu bankamwie madalaka goa, nukube jweno aboka ku Nnoongo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bai ngaboka penia pa mecha, ngabeka umbwega lutando lwakwe, ngatola kitambala nukukiundika mukibuno. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngajela maache muntungati, ngatumbu kajelea makongono akinapunji bakwe nukuungula nikitambala echi akiundike. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bai nganhwikili Simoni Petulo, jwombe Petulo ngalenga, “Angwana, mwe mpa kunyelea neenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Echandenda ngoe mikimanyije, nambu mammanya mwenekandae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petulo ngannengela, “Mwe unyeleaje makongono!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Anda nukunnyeleaje mme nanengaje pamwe kabele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo nganyanga, “Angwana makanyelea makongono tuje, unyeleye na maboko gango na mutwe uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Ojwa jomwi kujoga apaligwije ukuya ila makongono gambu abi chwapi mmele gwoa, mangweto mmi chwapi nambu mmoaje.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ammanyi ojwapakung'aluka, nga maana alenga, “Mmoaje mammi chwapi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pajomola kajelea makongono nukwinda kabele lutando lwakwe, ngatama pamecha ngabalenge, “bo, mmanyingite genia aganantendelinge? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mangweto ungema aboli na Angwana, mangweto nnonge chambone, ngapambile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bai andane nambi naboli na Angwana nannyeleinge mangweto makongono, na mangweto mpaligwa kujeleana makongono. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nampilingite kulandanakia ibe mangwetumwe ntendi andi panantendilinge <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweeli, mmanda nkolongwaje kumpeta nngwana mundu, wala ndundame nkolongwaje kupeta jwajo ojwantumite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bai anda mmikumanya genia mammaganga mbaya anda magatendite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ganga ganongela gano giinu mmoaje. Ne namaanyi banachagwile. Nambu mpaka oti gatimie Majandiko Machwapi agalenga, ‘Jwajo jwali chakulya chango ang'alambwike.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nenga nannengalinge ilebe yenje ngoe tango nukupitilaje, ibe paibakupitila mpatange kuamini kube ‘nga nenga.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, ojwampoke jwajo junantuma amboke ne, na ojwamboke nenga bapoke abandumite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola apakugalukigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pajomola kulonge genia, Yesu ngaechuka umwojo ngachalakicha kulenga, “Nannenge kweli, jumwe kati jinu apakung'aluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabalolana, baotwije kumanya bannonge mmene. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Jumwe kati ja akinapunji, jwombe Yesu ojwakampala muno, akiba atamite papipi na Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo ngankinyila nukulenga, “Makonye balonge geniago kwa magambu ga beneke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Napunji jwenio ngaegelela papipi muno na Yesu, ngankonya, “Angwana, nga beneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Jwajo jwambakumpe kipande cha nkate chanelite muchaani, ngajweno.” Bai ngatola kipande cha nkate ngalela muchaani ngampe Yuda mwana jwa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda papokela kipande chenie, Lichetani ngilinnyingila. Yesu ngannengela, “Champakutenda ntende chokwe!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu akibaje wala jumwe kati jabe ojwatamite pamecha ojwaamanyi alenga genia kwa magambu gani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa magambu Yuda akiba mmeka ela kati jabe, bapemelela Yesu annenge Yuda ajende akaemele eipaligwa kusikukuu, andaje annenge apange chachotichela kwa akaocho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bai Yuda apajomola kutola kipande cha nkate chela ngapita panja chokwe. Ikiba kilo.</para>
  <para style="s">Amuli nhyono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuboka tu Yuda, Yesu ngalenga, “Ngoe Mwana jwa Mundu akoigwe, na Nnoongo akoigwe nkati jakwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Na anda kibumo cha Nnoongo kiekwike nkati ja Mwana, bai mwene Nnoongo apakuekula kibumo cha Mwana nkati jakwe mwene, na matenda genia chokwe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akinangota bango, tango mbi namangweto kwa kingobu chenje tu. Mpakumbala, nambu ngoe nanenge gaga ganalengela achilongochi ba Akayahudi, ‘Kunyenda mangweto kuotoje kujenda!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nampeganga amuli nhyono, mpalane andi panampalanga mangweto. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Anda mpaline mangweto jika, bandu mabamanya mangweto makinapunji bango.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola Petulo apakungana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo ngankonya, “Angwana nyenda ko?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Kunyenda kuotoje kungengama ngoe, nambu maungengama mwenakandae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Petulo ngankonya, “Angwana, kwani kuotoje kunkengama ngoe? Mbi laachi kuwe kwa magambu ginu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo, mmi laachi kuwe kwa magambu gango?” Nannenge tango na nkokoloko kubekaje mpakungana patatu.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndela ja kweeli kwa Awawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Makaechukaje mumyojo jinu. Muamini Nnoongo, nhwaminiange na nenga uyo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kachabe Awawa bango mubi niitamo ndu, ngoe nyenda kupanga paali kwa ajili jiinu. Ikabi yeneje kabi nanengalinge. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Anda nyabwile kumpanganakia paali kwa ajili jiinu, mambuja kuntolanga ili namangweto mmegange pambi nenga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mijimanyingite ndela ja kujenda kweno kunyenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomasi ngankonya, “Angwana, tumanyije ukwannyenda, tupakuotobo kujimanya ndela jene?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Nenga nga ndela, na kweeli na bwomi, abije jwaotwile kujenda ka Awawa ila kukupetela kwango. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, anda umanyi nenga, mammanyi na Awawa bango uyo. Na mpaka ngoe mammanyi, kabe mabweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filipo ngannengela, “Angwana, mutulangile Awawa, na twe aputupala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nganyanga, “Ndamite na mangwetumwe kingobu choeche, na gwe Filipo umanyije? Ojwa mweni neenga babweni Awawa. Nhwotobo kulenga ‘mutulangi Awawa’? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bo Filipo, kuaminije mbi nkati ja Awawa na Awawa babi nkati jango?” Kibokachapena Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Malobe ganannenge kwa madalaka gangoje, nambu Awawa bababi nkati jango, bakamu maengo gabe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpaligwa kuamini panenga nenga mbi nkati ja Awawa na Awawa babi nkati jango. Andaje, nhwaminiange kwa magambu ga ilebe yandenda. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nanenge kweeli, ojwanhwamini apakutenda ilebe yambakutenda nenga, abakutenda ata makolongwa muno, kwa magambu nyenda kwa Awawa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na chachoa chela champa kujopa kwa liina lyango mandenda, kupala Awawa balumbigwe nkati ja mwana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anda unyopangite chachoa chela kwa liina lyango, mandenda.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhuke ba Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Anda umbailinge makamula Malagilo gango. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nanenga manajopa Awawa nabenia mabampa jonge jukunnyangata, ojwapakutama na mangweto lemulemu pangapela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jweno nga Uhuke jwa kweeli jwa Nnoongo. Dunia kuotoje kumpokela magambu kuotoje kummona wala kummanya. Nambu mangweto mumanyi magambu baigi namangweto na babi nkati jiinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nanekangaje mangweto ukeba, mainka kabele kwinu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tango kachoko na jene dunia jimonaje kabele nambu mangweto mammona, na magambu ne namomi, namangweto uyo mamma mammomi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lichoba lyale palipa kuika mammanya nenga mbi nkati ja Awawa, na mangwetomwe mi nkati jango, nane nkati jinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ojwapokela amuli jango na kujikengama jweno nga ojwambala nenga. Na ojwambala nenga mapaligwa na Awawa bango na nenga manampala na kukilaya kujweno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yuda jweno Yuda Isikaliotije, ngannengela, “Angwana, kuotolabo mwe kukilaya kwito nukube kuduniaje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Mundu anda ambaile akengame mapundicho gango, na Awawa bango mabampala, natwe matuika nukutama nabo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Jwangambala ukengamaje maboulo gango. Nililobe elimilijoina lela ngiti lyangoje, ila lyabe Awawa abandumitage.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nannengilinge ilebe yene mangobu mbitango pamwe na mangweto. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu Nnyangati, jweno Uhuke jwa Chwapi, jwombe Awawa bapakuntuma kwa liina lyango, mammola kila kilebe nukunkombokelanga yoa einanengalinge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nanekela tengela, nampeganga tengela jango. Nampe andi pijitenda duniaje, makabe nambweleje wala kuechuka. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nganyoanga panannengala, ‘Ne ndendakujabula, mambuja kabele kwinu.’ Makambailinge kabi mmi nalaa, kumagambu nyenda ka Awawa, benia akolongwa kumbeta ne. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nannengelanga genia ngoe tango nukupitilaje, ibe pagapakupitila mme unhwamininge. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nonge kabeje namangwetomwe ilebe ijingi kumagambu nkolongwa jwa dunia jeno atendakuwika, akwetije makakala kumbeta ne. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu dunia jipaligwa kumanya napala Awawa, ngakwamana ndenda kila kilebe andi Awawa pabaamuliche.</para>
  <para style="p">“Nnyemange tuboke pamba!</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nga nzabibu gwa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nenga nzabibu gwa kweli, Awawa bango alemi <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila lutambi nkati jango lwangapambika ngoko benia kuluboya, nakila lutambi olupambike kuluunila kupala lupambike muno. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mangweto mwe mmilingite chwapi kwa magambu ga nhwalo go gunanengile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ntamange nkati jango, nane mandama nkati jinu. Andi yene lutambi kuotwaje jika jakwe kupambika ngoko nukutamaje munkongo gwa zabibu, na yene uyo mangwetomwe kuotwaje kupambika ngoko nukutamaje nkati jango.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nenga nga nzabibu, mangweto mwe ndambi. Ojwatama nkati jango na ne anda mbi nkati jakwe jweno mapambika ngoko majingi. Mana na neje, nhwotolangaje kutenda chachoa chela. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa jola anda nukutamaje nkati jango, kunneke panja andi lutambi nu kujoma. Bandu kulokota ndambi andi yene nukuilekela pamwoto itinike. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Anda ntamite nkati jango na malobe gango anda gatamite nkati jinu, bai, nnyopechachoa chela mampata. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kibumo cha Awawa bango kibonekane anda mpambike ngoko majingi nukube akinapunji bango. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nenga nampailinge andi Awawa pabambaile nenga, ntamanga mumapalano gango. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Anda nkamwile amuli jango mantamanga mumapalano gango, andi yene nenga pangamwile amuli ja Awawa nukutama mumapalano gabe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nannengile ilebe yenie mbala laa jango jibe nkati jinu nalaa jinu jikomale. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Jenje nga amuli jango, mpalane andi panampala mangweto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gabije mapalano makolongwa muno kupeta mapalano ga mundu jwaboya bwomi gwakwe kumagambo ga kaganja mundu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe makaganja bango anda nteilinge ganunhwamulicha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe nankema kabeje makapakachi, mana mpakachi kumanyaje gabatenda angwana mundu, nambu nenga nankema mangweto makaganja kumagambu nanandulile goa ganajoa kuboka ka Awawa bango. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mangweto unjagulingeje ne, nambu ne nanchagwile nukuntuma nnyende mukapambike ngoko, ngoko agalama, bombe Awawa bampe chachoachela champa kujopa kuliina lyango. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bai amuli jango kwinu nga jenje, mpalane.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuchimwa kwa dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Anda dunia janchimwa mangweto, nkombakela jinjimwite oti nenga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Makabi mabandu bapadunia, dunia kabi jimpaile andi bandu baakwe. Nambu kwa magambu mangweto bapaduniaje, ila ne nanchagulinge kuboka padunia, kwa magambu genia dunia janchimwanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkombokelange aganannengelinge, ‘Mmanda nkolongwaje kumpeta nngwanamundu.’ Anda bandu bambotike ne, bapakumpotekanga namangweto uyo, anda bandu bagapenekia maboulo gango, mabagapenekia naginu uyo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu genia goa mabantendela mangweto kwa magambu mangweto mwe bango, magambu bumanyije jwajo ojwa ndumite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nakabi nukuwikaje nukulonge nabo, bakabinagoje mabaja, nambu ngoe kuotwaje kukikoola kube banga mabaja. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abanjimwa nenga, bachimwa Awawa bango uyo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ikabi nukutendaje kwabe eibi yangatenda mundu jwajotejola, bakabije na mabaja, nambu ngoe baloile gandendite ngabanjimwanga na Awawa bango uyo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nga kwamaana gaga gagaandikigwe Mumalagilo gabe kweli, ‘Batekunjimwanga pangamalemwa.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Papakuika nnyangati, jwenio Uhuke jwa Nnoongo, jwambakuntuma kwinu kuboka kwa Awawa, jweno Uhuke ba Nnoongo, apakunjalakicha ne. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Namangwetumwe uyo maunjalakicha kwa magambu makiba na ne pamwe pitumbala.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nannengila genia kupala mikijilekaje imani jinu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bandu bapakumenga mangweto mumajumba gabe ga kugongalela. Kabele kingobu kitenda kuika iba kila ojwapakunkoma mangweto akita atenda yapala Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bapakuntenda ilebe yene kwa magambu bamanyije Awawa, na bammanyije ne. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bai nannengile ilebe yene ibe kingobu chakwe echikipakuika nkombokele nanengile.</para>
  <para style="s">Maengo ga Uhuke ba Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">“Nanengilingeje ilebe yenje kuboka pitumbulaga magambu nakiba pamwe na mangweto. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu ngoe nanyendelela jwajo ojwandumite, na abije na jumweje jwangonya nyenda ko? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ngoe nanengelinge ilebe yene, mmilingite echu mumyojo jinu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu nanengelinge kweli, mbaya jinu mangweto ne nyabule, maana anda nukujabuje Nnyangati jo aikaje kwinu. Nambu anda nyabwile, manantuma kwinu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jwombe apapakuika apakalenge kweli bandu bapadunia mabaja gabe, na gapala Nnoongo na hukumu jakwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Balemwanga kwa magambu ga mabaja, babi kunhwaminije ne. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Balemwanga kwa magambu ga agapala Nnoongo, kwa yene nyenda kwa Awawa, mangweto umonangaje kabele, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na balemwanga ku nhwalo gwa hukumu, nkolongwa jwa dunia jenje ahukumigwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Mbinago nduu gu kunengela, nambu ngoe kuotoje kugakamula. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu apapakuika Uhuke jwa kweli mabalongelea kukweli joa, mana ailenga kwa madalaka gakweje, nambu ainengala agapakujoa, na apakunenge ilebe ipakuika. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jweno apakungoya nenga kwa magambu apakunnengela gaga agapakupata kuboka kwango. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yoa ibakweti Awawa nga yango, ngamana nengita jweno Uhuke ba Nnoongo apakunenge gaga agapakupata kuboka kwango.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwechuka mmojo na laa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Kingobu tango kachoko mangwetumwe umonaje, nakuboka pakingobu kachoko maumona kabena!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji bakwe bange ngabakonyana, “Babi na mana gako pabatulenge, ‘Tango kingobu kachoko mangweto umonaje, na kuboka pakingobu kichoko maumonage?’ Kabe alenga, ‘Nukube nyenda ka Awawa!’ ” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bai ngababe bakakonyana, “Babi na mana gako pabalenga, ‘Tango kingobu kichoko?’ Tumanyije echa longela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya bapaila kunkonya, bai ngabalenge, “Bo, nkonyana magambu ganongila gala, ‘Tango kingobu kachoko mangweto umonaje, na kuboka pakingobu kachoko maumonanga kabele?’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nanenge kweli, mangweto mpakuguta nu kokaleka, nambu dunia jipakube na laa. Mpakuwechuka nambu kuwechuka kwinu kuba kugalambuka kube laa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kingobu amama pabakikombola mwana balola kuwechuka magambu ga kubinia kuiike, nambu anda bajomwi kukikombola kukukomboke kabeleje kubinia ko kumagambu ga laa kube mundu abelwike padunia. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mangwetu mwe uyo mmimukuwechuka ngoe, nambu manunhwikalila kabele, namangweto mpakube na laa mumyojo jinu, na laa jene abije mundu ojwapakuboya kwinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Lichoba lyene minyopaje chachoa. Kweli nanenge, chachoa champakajopa Awawa kuliinalyango, mabampa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mpaka ngoe manajopaje chachoa kuliina lyango. Nnyopange mangweto mampata kupala laa jinu jilimbe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nijiotwile dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nanengila ilebe yenje kukichobo nambu kingobu makiika penia nonge kabeje kukichobo, ninengela ndaa ga Awawa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lichoba lyene mpakujopa kuliinalyango, na nanengije mbakajopa Awawa kumagambu ginu mangweto, <verse number="27" style="v"/>mana Awawa bampala mangweto, kumagambu mangweto umbala ne na nhwamini moka ku Nnoongo, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nenga ngamoka ka Awawa, nganhika padunia nangoche ndenda kujileka dunia na kubuja ka Awawa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bai akinapunji baakwe ngabanenge, “Hoo! Ngoe nnenga kindema muno panga kichobo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngoe tumanyi mwe mmanyi kila kilebe, kibije kilebe chukunkonya mundu jwajoa, na yene tuamine mmoka ku Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngaba janga, “Bo, nhwamininge ngoe? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kingobu kitenda kuika, kabe kiike, iba mangweto mmoa mmaganga mpwilikine kila mundu kachakwe na ne uneka jika jango. Pibile, nambu ne jika jangoje, magambu Awawa babi pamwe na ne. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nanengelinge ile yenje ili mmegange na tengela kukulondana nanenga. Dunia jipakumpeganga kulaga, nambu nhwimbililange! Ne nijiotwile dunia!”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bajopela akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apajomola kulenga genia, ngalola kunani kumbengu, ngalenga, “Awawa, mangobu gaike! Mankoleye Mwana jwinu na jweno Mwana apate kunkoleya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Andi yene ngamampe mwanajwinu kinala kubandu boa, kupala mapegange bwomi gu machoba goa pangapela kubenia boa abamapile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nabwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela nga gongono, bummanye mwenga mammi jika jinu Nnoongo jwa kweli, nukummanya Yesu kilisto oju muntumite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nenga nankolie pamba padunia, ngamilishe liengo eliumbile ndende. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ngoe, Awawa, ungoleye nnongi jinu kukibumo cha ngweti tangu nukupanganaje dunia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Nantendite mmanyikane ku bandu baba abaumbile kuboka kudunia. Bakibanga bandu binu, nane ngumbe babe bango. Na benia bilikamulinge lilobe linu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngoe bamanyi kila echiumbile kibokita kwinu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nenga napilangite malagilo agaumbile, na benia bapokalinge, bamanyangite kweli mokite kwinu, na baamininge mwenga makande kunduma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Najope angweto, nijijope duniaje, nambu najopela bumbile, gambu nga binu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Goa gambinago nga ginu, naginu nga gango, na kibumo chango kibonakine mubenia abaumbile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na ngoe nhika kwinu. Mbikabeje padunia nambu angweto babi padunia. Awawa Bachwapi! Kwa makakala ga liina linu eliumbile, chonde malolelange gwicho babegange kilebe chimwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apanakibanabo, nenga nganalolelanga gwicho kumakakala ga liina linu liumbile. Nenga nalolile, abije ata jumwe jwajomwike. Nambu jwajo jumwe mwana jwa obite ili Majandiko Machwapi gatimie. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bai ngoe nhika kwinu, nanongile ilebe yenje padunia, ili baotolange kutama kwambone mulaa jango. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nenga napilangite malagilo giinu, na bandu bapadunia ngabaachimwanga, magambu angweto bapaduniaje, andi yene nenga napadunia panoje. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nyopa maboyange paduniaje, nambu nyopa malolele na jwajo Mmaja. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Angweto bapaduniaje andi nenga nambi bapikilamboje. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bajeguye kwa kweli, lilobe linu nga kweli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anda yene ungingita padunia, nane uyo natumangite padunia. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Na kwa magambo gabe namwene nikilumike kupala namangweto uyo bajeguigwe mukweli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Najopilanga angwetotuje, nambu najopelanga na bange bandu abapa kuamini nenga kuboka mulilobe lyabe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nyopa ili booa babe kilebe chimwe. Awawa! Nyopa babe nkati jito, andi nyene mwe pammile nkati jango nane nkati jinu. Nyopa babe kilebe chimwe ilidunia jipate kuamini mwenga maungingite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neenga napilangite kibumo uchache chamamba nenga, ili babe kilebe chimwe andi twe tubi kilebe chimwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nenga mbe nkati jabe namwe mme nkati jango. Nanyopa malimbie na kube kilebe chimwe, ili dunia jimanye mwenga nte kunduma na ntenda kapala angweto andi paumbala nenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Awawa! Mbala aba abaumbile, babe pamwe nane penia pambile, ili bakibone kibumo chaumbile, kwa magambu mambai tango nukupanganaje dunia. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Awawa Bambone! Dunia jummanyije, nambu ne numanyi, nangweto bamanyi mwenga maundumite. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nammekite umanyikane kwabe, manyendekea kutenda nyene, ili mapalano gaminago kwango ube nkati jabe, nane mbe nkati jabe.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bammeka mumakakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apalongela genia, ngajenda kwiye ja lukemba olukemigwa Kidiloni, najweno pamwe nakinapunji bakwe. Paali penia pakiba na bositani, najweno Yesu ngajingi mweno pamwe nakinapunji bakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yuda, ojwang'aluka Yesu, apamaanyi paali pena, kila kingobu Yesu akongana na akinapunji bakwe kweno. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bai Yuda ngato kikundi cha manjolinjoli na akalenda kuboka kwa akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo, ngaika nabo pabositani bapotwi muli, niimbelembele na chilaa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu, kongo akamanya goa agapakumpata, ngapitila, ngabakonya, “Mampalanga meneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nabenia ngabannyangula, “Yesu jwa ku Nazaleti!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengela, “Nganenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yuda ojwa akanng'aluka Yesu, akiba ajemite penia pamwe nabo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bai Yesu apabalengelinge, “Nganenga,” ngababuja unyuma, ngabagweganga pae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya kabele, “Mampala mene?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabannyangula, “Yesu jwa ku Nazaleti!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “nanengalinge nganeenga. Anda umbala nenga malekange angweto bajabulange.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alenga genia ili gapate kutimia gaga agaakalenga, “Baba abaumbile nunhwoiteje ata jumwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo akiba na upanga, bai ngaucholomola, nganhweketa lichikilo lya kalelo mmanda jwa akung'i akolo. Mmanda jwenio akemigwa Malukusi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngannenge Petulo, “Mmuye upanga gwinu muala. Bo, nakanyweje kikombe cha matecho echibambi Awawa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnongi ja Nkung'i Nkolongwa ojwakonda Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kikuta cha akalenda, na akolongwa babe na akalenda ba Akayahudi ngabampuki Yesu, ngabantaba <verse number="13" style="v"/>ngabampeleka oti kwa Anasi. Anasi nga akimundu analome ba Kayafa, benia bakiba Akung'i Akolongwa chaka chene. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jwenio Kayafa ngaojwa balengela Akayahudi nga mbaya mundu jumwe awe kumagambu ga bandu.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo pamwe na napunji jonge ngabankengama Yesu. Napunji jonge jweno akate kumanyikana kwa akung'i akolo, uyo ngajingi pamwe na Yesu unyumba panchana pa akung'i akolo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo akiba ajemite panja, papipi na nniango. Bai napunji jonge jweno ojwakiba amanyikine kwa akung'i akolo ngapita panja ngalonge na mmanda munkege, nnende nniango, ngannyingia Petulo unyumba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Munkege nnenda jwa nniango ngankonya Petulo, “Bo, namwe uyo nga bamwe ba akinapunji ba mundu ojojo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngannenge, “Neje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Akabanda na akalenda bakiba bakoite mwoto kumagambu pakiba na malili, ngaba jotanga mwoto. Jwombe Petulo akiba ajemite pamwe nabo ajota mwoto.</para>
  <para style="s">Akung'i akolo bankonya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bai Akung'i Akolongwa ngaba nkonyeke Yesu nhwalo gwa akinapunji bakwe na maboulo gakwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyangula, “Nongile na kila mundu goa pukongolou. Kila kingobu mbundiche munyumba ja kunyopa Nnoongo na munyumba ja Nnoongo, paali apabakongana Akayahudi boa, na wala nengitije chachoti chela kwa kuiya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa nike ungonyekea nenga? Makonyekea baba abajoaninge nike nalengelinge. Angweto bamanyi aganalengelinge.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu palenga genia nnendei jumwe ojwa kiba ajemite penia ngamputa likopi nukulenga, “Bo, nga apamajanga akung'i akolo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Anda nengite mabaja, nchalakiche ubaja gweno, nambu anda nengite gambone, mboni umbuta?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bai Anasi ngampeleka Yesu abi atabigwe, kwa akung'i akolo Kayafa.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ankana Yesu kabele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petulo akiba penia ajota mwoto. Bai ngabankonya, “Bo, namwe uyo ngabamwe ba akinapunji bakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwenio ngakana nukulenga, “Neje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Jumwe jwa akapakachi ba Akung'i Akolongwa, nnongo gwa ojwaeketigwa lichikilo na Petulo, ngankonya, “Bo, mwe namwenije kukijongo pamwe na jwenio?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petulo ngakana kabele, kingobutu nkokoloko ngabeka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnongi ja Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bai pakiba kilokilo, ngabantolanga Yesu kuboka kwa Kayafa, ngabampeleka kuboma. Nangweto kupala baotolange kulye Pasaka, bajingilingije unyumba ja boma bakanangita kube nuchaapu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa nyene, Pilato ngapita panja, ngalenga, “Mmilingiti na machitaka gani na mundu jonjo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngabannyangula, “Anda jonjo akabi na malemwaje kabi tunetitije kwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pilato ngabalengela, “Aja, muntolange mmenimangweto, maka nhwukumu ukengama na malagilo ginu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Akayahudi ngaba nnyanga, “Twe tukwetije amuli ja kunkoma mundu jwajotijola.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Itendigwa nyenie japata kulenganila malobe agalenga Yesu kulaya apakuwe kiwe nike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pilato ngajingi kabe unyumba muboma, ngankema Yesu nukunkonya, “Eti mwe ngama ngwana ba Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Bo, genia nga malobe ginu au bange batennengela mialo jango?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilato ngannyangula, “Bo, ne Nayahudi? Bandu binu na akakung'i bannetite kwangone. Ntendite nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Kingwana chango chapa dunia jenjeje. Anda kingwana chango chakabi cha dunia jenje, akapakachi bango kabibambutanile nakabekigwaje mumaboko ga Akayahudi. Nambu ngoe kingwana chango nga chapambaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Penia Pilato ngannengela, “Bai mwe nga Mangwana?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajangula, “Mwe nnengite kutenda nenga Nangwana. Nenga melwike kwa magambu genia, na magambu genia nhike padunia nijichalakiche kweli ku bandu kila mundu jwabi mukweli jenie kumbenikia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pilato ngannenge, “Kweli nga nike?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aukumigwa kuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato apalenga genia, ngabajendele kabele Akayahudi panja, ngabalengela, “Nenga mbikulolaje lilemwa lyalyoa kwakwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nambu lubi lukobo nenga kunnekeke mpungwa jumwe mangobu ga Pasaka. Bai mpalanga nannyogolelange Nngwana jwa Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Penia ngabatenda manjega, “Ije! Jwenio je, manyogolele Balaba!” Balaba jwenio akiba mpoki.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bai Pilato ngaamulicha Yesu atoligwe aputigwe iboko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli ngagaloka ulembalemba gwa miba, ngabankwindiya umutwe, ngagankwindiya ngobo ndandamau jibakwindanga akangwana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kunhwikalila nnongi jakwe nukulenga, “Shikamoo, Angwana ba Akayahudi!” Ngabamputa makopi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato ngapita panja kabele, ngabalengela, “Nnolange, nanneta panja kwinu, mmegange mmanyi neenga nagabwenije malemwa gagoa kwakwe.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngapita panja, akwindite ulembalemba gwa miba nilijou libakwindanga akangwana. Pilato ngabalengela, “Nnolange! Mundu jwene nga ojo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na akalendei pabammona ngabatondobea lilobe, “Mammambe munchalaba! Mammambe munchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato ngalenga, “Bai mantolange, mmene mangweto makammambe munchalaba, magambu ne nagabwenije malemwa gagoa kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akayahudi ngabannyanga, “Twenga tukweti Malagilo, nakagakengama magambu ga Malagilo genia mpaka awe, magambu akitenda Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pilato apajoa malobe genia ngajogopa muno. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bai Pilato ngajingi muboma kabele, ngankonya Yesu, “Mmoka kole mwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu Yesu ajangitije. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilato ngannengela, “Kulongelaje na nenga? Bo, umanyije kutenda ngweti kinala chu kunnekekea ni kinala chu kummamba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Makabije na kinala chachoa kwango, akabi Nnoongo nukumpeje. Magambu genia, jwajo ojwangamuye ne kwinu abi na mabaja makolongwa muno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato apajoa genia, ngapala ndela jukunnekekea, nambu Akayahudi ngabachobela manjega, “Anda manekakie mundu jonjo, mwe maganjaje na nkolo jwa kilambo cha Loma. Kila mundu ojwakitenda nngwana ankana nkolo jwa kilambo cha Loma!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato apajoa malobe geniago, nganneta Yesu panja, ngatama pikitebwe cha hukumu, paali papakemigwa “Sakafu ja Maganga” kwa kilonge cha Akaebulania, ikonda Gabatha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ikiba kingobu cha nalumu, lichoba lya kupangania Pasaka. Pilato ngabalenge Akayahudi, “Jwenio Nngwana jwinu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Angweto ngabatondobea lilobe, “Mankome! Mankome! Mamambe munchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato ngabakonya, Bo, nammambe nngwana jwinu?</para>
  <para style="p">Akakung'i akolongwa ngabajanga, “Twenga tukwetije angwana nambu nkolongwa jwa Loma tu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Penia, Pilato ngankamuya Yesu mumaboko ga Akayahudi kupala bammambe munchalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abambigwa munchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Bai ngabantola Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na jwenio ngapita panja kongo apotwi nchalaba gwakwe kujenda paali papakemigwa “Kitongo cha Mutwe” Kwa kilonge cha Akaebulania ikonda Goligota. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Penia nga pabammamba Yesu, uyo bakabamba bandu bange abena, jumwe kingonu cha kalelo na jonge kingonu chakwe cha kangeja, Yesu panakati jabe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato ngaandika litangacho ngabeka panani ja nchalaba. Echibaandika, “Yesu ju Kunazaleti, Nngwana jwa Akayahudi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akayahudi ajingi ngabachoma litangacho lyene, mana paali penia pabambigwa Yesu pakiba papipi na Panyini. Kabe litangacho lyene likaandikigwa kwa kabila ja Kiebulania, Kilatini, na Kigiliki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bai akakung'i akolo ngabannenge Pilato, “Makaandikaje, ‘Nngwana jwa Akayahudi ila, Mundu jwenio alengita, nenga nangwana ba Akayahudi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato ngajanga, “Gaandike, andike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli kuboka pa kumamba Yesu, ngabatolanga ngobo yakwe, ngababagana mapungu ncheche, lipungu limwe kila linjolinjoli. Ngabatolanga na kanju jaakwe, kanju jene jikiba ilokigwe kukipande chimwe tu, janga nchono. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bai genia manjolinjoli ngagabeka machabuli, “Takapachulaje, nambu tutendi kiumbuumbu jibe jabene.” Nhwalo gweno utendigwa ili gatimie Majandiko ga Machwapi gagalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ngababagana kikwindo chango,</para>
  <para style="q">na ngobo yango ngabapigi kula.”</para>
  <para style="m">Bai yene ngapagatenda manjolinjoli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Papipi na nchalaba gwa Yesu bakiba bajemangite Amamundu, na alombo ba amamundu, Maliamu aanaba Kilopa, na Maliamu Magidalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu pababona amamundu, na papipi nabo ajemite jwajo napunji jwampaile, ngabalenge amamundu, “Amama, nnola, jweno nga mwana gwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuboka penia nganenge napunji jo, “Nola, benia nga amabinu.” Na kuboka kingobu chenie napunji jo ngabantola atame kachabe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngalola goa gatimie, na ili Majandiko Machwapi gapate kutimia, ngalenga, “Nola nyota.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Penia pakiba na ntungati utweli siki. Penia ngabachwika litonji musiki ngababeka mulutela lwa isopo, ngabammeka pakano. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu pachwena siki jenie, ngalenga, “Galenganile!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuboka penia ngakotima mutwe, ngajomoka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aomigwa nkuki pulubao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ikiba ijumaa, lichoba li kupangana. Yene kukupala mibele jikatamaje mumichalaba lichoba li Kupomalela, mana lichoba lyene li Kupomalela likiba likolongwa, Akayahudi ngabanyopa Pilato makongono ga benia ababambigwa gatwekuligwe na mibele jabe jiboigwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bai manjolinjoli ngagajenda, ngagatweku makongono ga jwajo mundu ju kutumbula na jwajo jwa pili benia bakiba bakabambigwa pamwe na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu pabanhwikalila Yesu, ngabalola awile, ku yene bantunwije makongono. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Linjolinjoli limwe ngalyampojola pulubao kwa nkuki, ni kingobu tu ngijipita myai na mache. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu ojwaubweni nhwalo gwenio achalakiche kupala mangweto mpate kuamini genia galongile nga ga kweli, kabe benia bamanyi balonge kweli. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nhwalo gweno utendigwa kupala Majandiko Gachwapi galenganile, “Kubeje wala kiupa chakwe chimwe chikipa kutwekuligwa.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kabe Majandiko gange galenga, “Bandu mabannolakea jwajo jubampojwile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Machiko ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuboka pa genia, Yusufu ju kilambo cha Alimatayo, ngannyopa Pilato ampe mmele gwa Yesu. Yusufu akiba napunji jwa Yesu, nambu jwachili, gambu bajogopa akiilongoi ba Akayahudi. Bai, Pilato ngajeketela. Yene Yusufu ngajenda, ngautola mmele gwa Yesu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Jwombe Nikodemo jweno akanyendele Yesu machoba ga unyuma kilo, ngaika kongo apotwile kiwanga cha mauta ga manemane na ubani kilo salasini. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bai ngubutola mmele gwa Yesu, ngaubiligila chanda pamwe na ilebe inakunungila andi lukobo lwa Akayahudi machiko gabe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Paali penia pabammamba Yesu pakiba kijongo, ni kijongo chenie likiba likabuli liyono tango lyanga nchika mundu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bai kumagambu ga maengo ga Akayahudi ga kupanganikia lichoba lya Kupomolela, na kumagambu likabuli libile, ngabammeka Yesu mwenio.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Likabuli jika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:1-12">Luka 14:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kindabi ndabi Jumapili, pakiba tango nu lubendu, Maliamu Magidalena ngajenda kulikabuli ngalibona libwe lela liboigwe paniango gulikabuli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bai ngajenda lubelo mpaka kwa Petulo na jwajo napunji jonge ojwampai muno Yesu, ngabalengelanga, “Bammoite Nngwana mulikabuli, na tukumanyije kubummekite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Petulo pamwe na napunji jongi jola ngabajendanga kulikabuli. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Boa akabele babutuka lubelo nambu jwajo napunji jongi jola ngabutuka kumpeta Petulo, ngalongelela kuika kulikabuli ko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Palita na kulinga mulikabuli ngakibona chanda, nambu ajingije nkati. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo na jweno ngaika akankengama, ngajingila mulikabuli. Mweno ngakibona chanda, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na kitambala chache chabantabali Yesu umutwe. Kitambala chenie kikiba pamweje na chanda ila kikiba kitundanigwe kibi pajika jakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kubokapenia jwajo napunji jwalongalile kuika kulikabuli, ngajingi uyo nkati ngalola, ngaamini. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bakiba tango banamanyaje Majandiko Machwapi gagalenga mpaka ayoke kuboka kwa abawile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bai akinapunji benia ngababuja kachabe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampitila Maliamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maluko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Maliamu akiba ajemite panja ja likabuli, akaguta. Kongo abi tango akaguta, ngalita nukulinga mulikabuli, <verse number="12" style="v"/>ngababona akapakachi abele bakwindite ngobo nhuu, batamite pubugonike mmele gwa Yesu, jumwe kumutwe na jonge kamakongono. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Akapakachi benia ngabakonya, “Amama mbona ntenda kuguta?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe ngajanga, “Baboyangite Angwana bango, na nukumanyije kababekite!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuboka pa kulenga genia, ngatendabuka unyuma, ngamona Yesu ajemite penia, nambu amanyije kutenda Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya, “Amama, nng'uta nike? Mampala meneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Maliamu apemelela jweno nnendei jwa bostani, ngannenge, “Angwana anda mwe ntekumoya, unengele kamabekite, nane nakatole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nganenge, “Maliamu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Na jweno Maliamu ngatendabuka nganenge Kiebulania, “Laboni!” Laboni mana gakwe Apundichi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nganenge, “Makangamuje, magambu nanajendaje tango kunani ka Awawa. Nambu nnyende kakanuna bango makalengele, ‘Nyenda kunani ka Awawa bango na Awawa binu, Nnoongo jwango na Nnoongo jwinu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yene Maliamu Magidalena ngajenda kwa akinapunji ngabalenge nhwalo gweno babweni Angwana, na banengi genia.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapitila akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ikiba kimuyo ja lichoba lyene lya Jumapili. Akinapunji bakiba bakongine pamwe unyumba, ni milyango jakiba jijigaligwe magambu batenda kajogopa achilongochi ba Akayahudi. Bai Yesu ngaika, ngajema panakati jabe, ngabalenge, “Tengela jibe kwinu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pajomola kulenga genia, ngabalaya maboko gakwe na lubao lwakwe. Bai akinapunji bakwe ngabaala mojo muno kabona Angwana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge kabele, “Tengela jibe kwinu! Andi Awawa apabandumite ne na ne nantuma mangweto.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabalumika angweto na kalenge, “Mpokelange Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Anda malekekeinge bandu mabaja gabe balekekeigwe anda nakalekekeje balekekeigwaje.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tomasi jumwe jwa akinapunji komi na abena, ojwa kemigwa Mabela, akibaje pamwe na angweto kingobu paika Yesu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bai baba akinapunji bangiba ngabanenge, “Tabweni Angwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">Tomasi ngabalenge anda, “Nagabwenije mabalilo ga michumali mukubokojabe na kubeka lukonji lwango palibalilo gena, na kubekaje luboko lwango pulubao lwabe, aminije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bai kuboka pa machoba nane akinapunji bala ngabakongana kabele unyumba, bakiba na Tomasi. Na milyango mujigale, nambu Yesu ngaika ngajema panakati jabe, ngalenga, “Tengela jibe kwinu.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngannenge Tomasi, “Nnete lukonji lwinu pamba na magabone maboko gango, nnete lukonji lwinu na meke pulubao lwango. Makabe na mbweleje, nhwuamini!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tomasi nganyanga, “Angwana bango na Nnoongo jwango!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nganenge, “Bo, nhwamini magambu umweni? Mbaya abaamini nukumonaje, nambu baamininge.”</para>
  <para style="s">Magambu ga kuandika kitabu chenje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu akalaya iingi yi ikobo ijingi nnongi ja akinapunji bakwe yenge yangaandikigwa mukitabu chenje. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu yenje iandikigwe ili mpate kuamini Yesu nga Kilisto, Mwana jwa Nnoongo, na kukunhwamini mpatange kube na bwomi kwa makakala ga liina lyakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapitilanga akinapunji saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pagenia, Yesu ngabapitila akinapunji bakwe kabele umbwega ja lilaba lya Tibelia. Ngaba pitilanga yene, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo, Tomasi ojwa kemigwa mabela, Natanaeli, jukukilambo cha Kana Galilaya, ingota ibele ya Zebedayo na akinapunji bakwe bange abele, bakibanga boa pamwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo ngabalenge, “Nyenda kulopola yamaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bombe ngabannengela, “Na twe tupakulongwana namwe.” Bai ngabajenda, ngabaombe muntumbwi, nambu kilo jene bapatangitije kilebe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pitumbula kuchee, Yesu akajema umbwega ja lilaba likolo. Nambu akinapunji bamanyije kutenda jwenio akiba Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngabakonya, “Achikakombo mpatiteje yamaki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Tupatitije kilebe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nnekele lipelele kingonu chakalelo ja ntumbwi, namangweto mampata yamaki.” Bai ngabalekela lipelele nambu ngoe baotwije kuuta kabele, magambu ikajoloka yamaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Penia napunji jwajo ojwapaligwe na Yesu ngannenge Petulo, “Ngangwana!” Simoni Petulo apajowa Ngangwana, ngakitaba ngobo jakwe maana akiba makengele, ngagoloke umache. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu baba akinapunji bange ngabaika kumbwani na ntumbwi kongo bakauta lipelele elitweli yamaki. Bakiba kutaalije na kujomo, ila bakiba kube kipemo cha meta mia jimwe kuboka muluboga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pabaika kujomo ngabaubona mwoto gwa makala upambigwe na panani jakwe pabekigwe yamaki na nkate. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nnetange pamba yenge yamaki yannopwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bai Simoni Petulo ngaombe muntumbwi, ngajomboka mpaka kujomo lipelele lyale elitweli yamaki ngolongolo mia jimwe na amusini na itatu, naiganukube yamaki ndu yene lipelele linyopwikije. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nhwikange nnabuke.” Akibaje wala jumwe kati ja akinapunji jwajigite kunkonya Yesu, “Mwe mabene?” Maana bamanyi benia Angwana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngaika, ngatola nkate, ngabape. Ngatenda uyo na yamakiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Penia pakiba kingobu cha patatu Yesu kapitila akinapunji bakwe kuboka ja kuyoka kuboka kwa abawile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pabajomola kulye, Yesu ngankonya Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana jwa Yohana! Bo, umbaile nenga kupeta ababa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngajanga, “Umo Angwana, umanyi nenga nampaile mwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngannengela, “Nng'oye yana yamambelele gango.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngannenge mala ja pabele, “Simoni mwana jwa Yohana, umbaile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngajanga, “Umo Angwana, umanyi nampaile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngannengela, “Nng'oye mambelele gango.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya mala ja patatu, “Simoni mwana jwa Yohana, Bo, umbaile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngaechuka magambu ankonyite mala ja patatu, “Umbaile?” Ngannengela, “Angwana, mwe mmanyi goa. Mwe mmanyi kutenda mbi kumpala.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngannengela, “Nng'oye mambelele gango. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nannengela kweli, pamakiba makakombo mayobalile kujenda okumpaala. Nambu pampakube machiokolo mpakutondobea maboko ginu, na mundu jonge apakuntaba na kumpeleka kwangapala kujenda.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kukulenga genia, Yesu alondola kiu chapakuwe Petulo na kunkoya Nnoongo. Kuboka penia ngannengela, “Ungengame!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na jwajo napunji jonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia Petulo ngatendabuka, ngammona jwajo napunji ojwampaile Yesu akakengama napunji jwenio ngajwajo jwatamita papipi na Yesu kingobu cha kulye ndalilo na kunkonya, “Angwana ngabeneke abapakung'aluka?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bai Petulo apammona jweno, ngankonya Yesu, “Angwana, ojo bo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Andambai aigale mpaka pambakuika, ganhusu nike? Ungengame!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bai nhwalo gweno nguujoanika kubene akangwetojika napunji jwenio ajomokaje. Nambu Yesu annengije kutenda ajomokaje. Ila ngalenga, “Anda mbala aigale mpaka pambakuika, ganhusu nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Jwenio nga napunji jwachalakicha genia nu kugaandika. Na twe tumanyi agalongile nga kweli.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ibi ilebe yenge ijingi yatendite Yesu. Yene ikaandikigwe yoa, chimwe chimwe, mbemele ata dunia jene jakabi ikwelitije.</para>
</usx>
